  <para style="toc3">Lef</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lefitikọs</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ufọfọb Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakoot Moses, anyʌñ atie ke atayad mbono atañ ikọ anọ anye. Anye amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Ke ini awo ndufo ndomokeed abenne enọ asọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, yak aben unam ato ke atu udịmenañ me atu udịmedọñ adi.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />“ ‘Enọ ado akpedo ufọfọb uwa a-atooho udịmenañ, afo anie adiwa ayaara i-imiinieghe ndo. Ana afo aben anye akenọ ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono, nọ ato do <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiibọ anye. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Afo anie adiben ubọk mfo ndot ke iwuod ufọfọb uwa ado, ndin eyaebọ anye ke iwuod mfo nọ edat enam ñkpeubọk unọ fiin. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Afo anie adiwot ñyịn ayaaraenañ ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin nditọ ideen Erọn, mme aku, eyaeben iyiib ado enyʌñ esiime ekanna akpokoro uwa ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Afo anie adiyaara ikpa ufọfọb uwa ado, anyʌñ akpok anye ñkeñe-ñkeñe. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Nditọ ideen aku Erọn enie adisịn ikañ ke akpokoro uwa ado, enyʌñ eneeñe ifia edọñ ke ikañ. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Ndin nditọ ideen Erọn e-edooho mme aku, eyaeneeñe mme ñkikʌk unam ado, akọrọ ye iwuod ye akpọñ, ebono ke ifia a-asakka ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Afo anie adidat mmọọñ ñyet ñkpọ mme ñkpọ esịd idịb ye mme ukod, ndin aku anie adifọp afịd ñkpọ ado ke akpokoro uwa. Anye ado ufọfọb uwa, uwa ndidia, uwa a-anemme ufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“ ‘Uwa ado akpedo ufọfọb uwa a-atooho ufene, me ato edọñ me ato ebod, afo anie adinọ ayaara i-imiinieghe ndo. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Afo anie adiwot anye ke akpokoro uwa ukañ adoro, ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin nditọ ideen Erọn, mme aku, eyaeben iyiib ado esiime ekanna akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Afo anie adikpok anye ñkeñe-ñkeñe, ndin aku ayaaneeñe ammọ abon, ye iwuod ye akpọñ ke ifia a-asakka ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Afo anie adiyet mme ñkpọ esịd idịb ye mme ukod ke mmọọñ, ndin aku anie adiben afịd mme ñkpọ ado ndifọp ke akpokoro uwa. Ado ufọfọb uwa, uwa ndidia, uwa a-anemme ufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“ ‘Adieke uwa e-eyemme adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adooho ufọfọb uwa e-ekamake mme inuen, afo anie adinọ ibiom, imiidooho afo anọ ñyịn abomoñkuku. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Aku anie adiben anye ndi akpokoro uwa, ana afiakka anye itọñ asio, anyʌñ afọp anye ke akpokoro uwa; ndin anyịmme iyiib ado asio aduọk ke mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Anye anie adisio akpənitọñ, afịp ñwa amọ, anyʌñ atop ammọ abon ke ukañ usakkautịn akpokoro uwa, ke itie a-ntọñ abonoke. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Anye ayaasiak anye akʌppọ ke mba, ado idiaññake isio afịd-afịd, ndin aku ayaafọp anye ke ifia a-asakka ke akpokoro uwa. Ami ado ufọfọb uwa, uwa ndidia, uwa a-anemme ufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ñkpasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />“ ‘Awo ndomokeed amaadat uwa ñkpasi asọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, uwa ado ana ado ataa eti ndomuyo a-anekkeke afọn. Andiben ndi anie aditọkkọ adan ọlif nsịn ke esịd, adot insensi, <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />ndin aben asọk nditọ ideen Erọn, mme aku. Aku ayaawoppo ubọk ndomuyo keed ye adan, adian ye afịd insensi ado, anyʌñ afọp nte ñkpọ aditoiyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ñko ke Lefitikọs 2:9, 16</char></note> ke akpokoro uwa, uwa ndidia, uwa a-anemufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Ñyọhọnsʌhọ uwa ñkpasi anie Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ; anye ado ataa adisana ubaak uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />“ ‘Adieke afo abenne uwa ñkpasi e-enwanna ke itie usaññkpọ ndomuyo adi, ana edat ataa eti ndomuyo a-anekkeke afọn enam. Ana ado ndodoppo uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, ado enuakka ke adan ọlif, imiidooho anye ado mfefeere uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, ado edat adan ọlif efiọññọ. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Akpedo uwa ñkpasi mfo ado anye e-edatta usan ukwak efọp, enie edidat ataa eti ndomuyo a-anekkeke afọn ewuak ye adan enam, awo isịnne yiis. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Nuek anye ñkeñe-ñkeñe, nyʌñ sịn adan ke esịd; ado uwa ñkpasi. <verse eid="LEV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Akpedo etem uwa ñkpasi mfo ke ako atian, ana edat ataa eti ndomuyo a-anekkeke afọn ewuak ye adan ọlif enam. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Ben uwa ñkpasi e-edatta mme ñkpọ ami enam sọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ben nịm ke iso aku, a-adiiben anye ika akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Aku ayaasio ñkpọ aditoiyo ke uwa ñkpasi ado, anyʌñ afọp ke akpokoro uwa nte uwa ndidia, uwa a-anemme ufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Ñyọhọnsʌhọ uwa ñkpasi anie Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ; anye ado ataa adisana ubaak uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />“ ‘Inaaha asịn yiis ke uwa ñkpasi ndomokeed a-afo abenne asọk Abọọñ, sia inaaha afọp yiis me adanakwọọk ke uwa ndidia a-anọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Amekeme adiben ammọ nsọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte enọ akpa mfịd, ado inaaha efọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa nte anemufịk ñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Sịn inʌñ ke afịd uwa ñkpasi mfo. Kuuyak inʌñ edioomo Abasi mfo anana ke uwa ñkpasi mfo; sịn inʌñ ke afịd uwa mfo.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />“ ‘Adieke afo abenne uwa ñkpasi akpa mfịd asọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ben iwuod ufa ñkpasi e-emaekenuekke efọp ke ikañ di. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Sịn adan ye insensi ke esịd; anye ado uwa ñkpasi. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Aku ayaafọp ubaak unuenuek ñkpasi ado a-adooho ñkpọ aditoiyo ye adan, ye afịd insensi ado, nte uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ewuana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />“ ‘Akpedo uwa mfo ado uwa ewuana, ndin afo asio unam ke atu udịmenañ adi, me ado ayaara me ado uman, afo anie adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unam i-imiinieghe ndo. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Ana afo aben ubọk mfo adot ufene uwa ado ke iwuod, anyʌñ abak anye ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. Ndin nditọ Erọn, mme aku, eyaesiime iyiib ado ekanna akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Ayaadat ubaak uwa ewuana ami adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa ndidia, ñkpọ esịd idịb ye afịd akpọñ se idọñọ ke esịd, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />naña ekpuud iba ye akpọñ a-adianake ye ammọ, a-akpereke isịn, ye anyan udʌk a-ayịreke ke ati, a-afo adiisio ye mme ekpuud. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Ndin nditọ Erọn enie edifọp anye ke akpokoro uwa ke anyọñ ufọfọb uwa a-adoroke ke eboho ikañ; ado uwa ndidia, uwa a-anemme ufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />“ ‘Adieke afo asioho unam ke atu udịmedọñ anam uwa ewuana anọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana afo anọ ayaara me uman i-imiinieghe ndo. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Afo ukpunọ ñyịn edọñ, ana aben enọ mfo adi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />dot ubọk mfo ke iwuod amọ, nyʌñ wot anye ke iso atayad mbono. Ndin nditọ ideen Erọn eyaesiime iyiib ado ekanna akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Ayaadat ubaak uwa ewuana ami adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa ndidia, akpọñ amọ, afịd isịm ado, wuọ isịn, ñkpọ esịd idịb ye afịd akpọñ se idudian ammọ ke idem, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />naña ekpuud iba ye akpọñ a-adianake ammọ, a-akpereke isịn, ye udʌk a-ayịreke ke ati, afo uduusio keed ye mme ekpuud. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Aku ayaafọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa nte uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“ ‘Akpedo uwa enọ mfo ado ebod, anie adiben anye ndi iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />adot anye ubọk ke iwuod anyʌñ abak anye ke iso atayad mbono. Ndin nditọ Erọn eyaesiime iyiib ado ekanna akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Ayaadat ubaak enọ mfo adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa ndidia, ñkpọ esịd idịb ye afịd akpọñ se idudian ammọ ke idem, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />naña ekpuud iba ye akpọñ a-adianake ammọ, a-akpereke isịn, ye anyan udʌk a-ayịreke ke ati, a-afo uduusio udian ye mme ekpuud. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Aku ayaafọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa nte uwa ndidia, anemufịk ndidia. Afịd akpọñ ado anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />“ ‘Ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana ke ini iso, ke itie akeedodo a-andufo edʌññọ. Inaaha ndufo eta akpọñ ndomokeed, inyʌññọ ina enwọñ iyiib.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ufeen Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate: ‘Ke ini awo ndomokeed anamma idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam ke adinam ñkpọ a-mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpanna:<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />“ ‘Adieke aku e-emaekeyet adan anamma idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana</char></note>, aben ubiomikpe asọk mbon awo, ana anye aben ñyịn enañ i-imiinieghe ndo adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ ke abaña idiọọkñkpọ a-anye anamma. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Anye anie adiben ñyịn ayaaraenañ ndinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. Ana anye adot ayaaraenañ ado ubọk ke iwuod anyʌñ abak anye ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Ndin aku e-emaekeyet adan ayaaben ubaak iyiib ayaaraenañ ado adʌk esịd atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Ana aku anyiin nnuunubọk amọ ke iyiib ado asiime usʌk iyiib ado akañ itiaba ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke iso ikpeghe adisana itie. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Anye ndin ayaaduọk ubaak iyiib ado ke nnʌk akpokoro uwa anem ufịk insensi a-abaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke atayad mbono. Anye ayaaben iyiib ayaaraenañ a-asʌhọke aduọk ke isọñ itie akpokoro ufọfọb uwa ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Ayaasio afịd akpọñ ke idem ayaaraenañ uwa idiọọkñkpọ, afịd akpọñ se isịne ke ñkpọ esịd idịb, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />naña ekpuud iba ye akpọñ a-adianake ammọ, a-akpereke isịn, ye anyan udʌk a-ayịreke ke ati, anye adiisio keed ye mme ekpuud, <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />kpa naña esio akpọñ a-asịneke ke abaakenañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru akeme ido ayaara me uman</char></note> ekewaaha nte uwa ewuana. Ndin aku ayaafọp ammọ ke akpokoro ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Ado amaado ikpa ayaaraenañ ye afịd abʌk amọ, dian ye iwuod ye ukod, mme ñkpọ esịd idịb ye mme nsia, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />a-adooho afịd unam se isʌhọ, ana anye aben awuọ akpọñ itie nnaa aka itie se isana, itie e-eduọkkọ ntọñ, anyʌñ afọp ammọ do ke ikañ ifia ke anyọñ eboho ntọñ.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />“ ‘Adieke afịd esob Isrel enamma idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam ke adinam ñkpọ se mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpan, akpekọm ndudue ado adedịbe ke anyen esob, ammọ emaedikịt ndudue ammọ <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />ndin idiọọkñkpọ a-ammọ ekenamma adiyaara, esob ana aben ñyịn ayaaraenañ adi atayad mbono adinọ nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Mme ñkpisọñ ke abio ana edot ubọk ammọ ke iwuod ayaaraenañ ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin eyaewot ayaaraenañ ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Ndin aku e-emaekeyet adan anie adidat ubaak iyiib ayaaraenañ ado ndʌk atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Aku ayaanyiin nnuunubọk amọ ke iyiib ado aben asiime akañ itiaba ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke iso ikpeghe adisana itie. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Anye anie adidat ubaak iyiib ado ñyeet ke nnʌk akpokoro uwa a-abaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke atayad mbono. Ndin anye ayaaben iyiib se isʌhọ aduọk ke isọñ itie ufọfọb uwa ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Ayaasio afịd akpọñ ke idem unam ado, anyʌñ afọp anye ke akpokoro uwa, <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />anyʌñ anam ye ayaaraenañ ado ukem naña akenam ye ayaaraenañ uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ. Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ atu awo, ndin eyaefeen enọ ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Amaama anye ayaaben ayaaraenañ ado awuọ ke itie nnaa akefọp naña akefọp akpa ado. Ami ado uwa idiọọkñkpọ atu awo.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />“ ‘Adadusʌñ amaanam idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam ke adinam ñkpọ se mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ akpan, anye amaakịt ndudue amọ <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />nọ ediọọñọ ebaña idiọọkñkpọ se anye akenam, ana anye aben akpoebod i-imiinieghe ndo adi nte ñkpọ uwa amọ. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Anye anie adiben ubọk amọ ndot ke iwuod ebod ado, ñnyʌñ mbak anye ke itie esibakka ñkpọ ufọfọb uwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye ado uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Aku ndin ayaadeep nnuunubọk amọ ke iyiib uwa idiọọkñkpọ ado ayeet ke mme nnʌk itie ufọfọb uwa, anyʌñ aben iyiib se isʌhọ aduọk ke isọñ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Anye ayaafọp afịd akpọñ ado ke akpokoro uwa naña akefọp akpọñ uwa ewuana. Ntom ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ idiọọkñkpọ adadusʌñ, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />“ ‘Ñkaña awo ndomokeed akpenam idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam ke adinam ñkpọ se mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpan, emaedikịt ndudue amọ <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />nọ ediọọñọ ebaña idiọọkñkpọ se anye akenam, ana anye aben uman ebod i-imiinieghe ndo adi nte ñkpọ uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Anye anie adidot ubọk amọ ke iwuod ñkpọ uwa idiọọkñkpọ ado, anyʌñ abak anye ke itie ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Aku ndin ayaadeep nnuunubọk amọ ke iyiib ado ayeet ke nnʌk akpokoro ufọfọb uwa, anyʌñ aben iyiib se isʌhọ aduọk ke isọñ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Anye ayaasio afịd akpọñ, kpa naña esio akpọñ ke uwa ewuana, ndin aku ayaafọp anye ke akpokoro uwa nte anemufịk uwa anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd. Ntom ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ anye, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />“ ‘Awo akpeben ñyịn edọñ adi nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, anye anie adiben uman i-imiinieghe ndo ndi. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Ana any adot ubọk amọ ke iwuod edọñ ado anyʌñ abak anye nte ñkpọ uwa idiọọkñkpọ ke itie esibakka ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Aku ndin ayaadeep nnuunubọk amọ ke iyiib uwa idiọọkñkpọ ado ayeet ke nnʌk akpokoro ufọfọb uwa, anyʌñ aben iyiib se isʌhọ aduọk ke isọñ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Anye ayaasio afịd akpọñ, kpa naña esio akpọñ ñyịn edọñ uwa ewuana, ndin aku ayaafọp anye ke akpokoro uwa adot ke uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ntom ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ anye ke idiọọkñkpọ a-anye akenamma, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />“ ‘Adieke awo adueghe ke adido anye akop naña ebo yak awo aditie ntiense me ata unwọñọ abaña se anye akịt me se anye adiọọñọ, ndin anye asịn, awo ado adot ufen.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />“ ‘Adieke awo ndomokeed adiọọñọke ke imọ imidue isob, adieke anye atuuho se imiisanake ke ndudue (me ado akpo ndedeghe unam ke ikọd me anye a-adʌññọ ke ufọk me ndedeghe unam a-anyọọnọ ke isọñ), ndin anye idiọọñọke ke ado anam nọ imọ ideghe, ado akema edidiọọñọ ndudue amọ; <verse eid="LEV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />me ke etuuho ndek awo (se adodo a-akpenamma nọ anye imiisanake) akpesʌkado anye imiikidiọọñọke, kpayeado anye adidiọọñọ abaña anye anyʌñ akịt ndudue amọ; <verse eid="LEV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />me awo asọp inua ata unwọñọ adinam ñkpọ akeedodo, me eti me idiọọk (ke ñkpọ ndomokeed a-awo akemeke adidat unwọñọ ke unana adikere) akpesʌkado anye imiidiọọñọke, akema anye adidiọọñọ anyʌñ akịt ndudue ammọ, <verse eid="LEV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />awo amaadidiọọñọ ke imidue isob ke mme ñkpọ ami, ana anye ayaara ndudue se anye anam. <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />Nte isob ke idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana, ke ufañ ami ye ke afịd iwuod ñwed ami</char></note> a-anye anamma, ana anye asio uman ñyịn edọñ me ebod ke atu udịmedọñ adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ. Ndin aku ayaanam ñkpeubọk anọ anye ke idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />“ ‘Awo ndomokeed i-imiinieghe ukeme adinọ ñyịn edọñ anie adidat ibiom iba me nditọ abomoñkuku iba nsọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte isob ke idiọọkñkpọ amọ, keed ado ake uwa idiọọkñkpọ, keed ado ake ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Anye anie adiben mme ñkpọ ami nsọk aku, adiibem iso inam uwa idiọọkñkpọ. Anye anie adifiakka anye itọñ, ado ikpịkkeke isio ikpọñ idem, <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />ndin anie adisiime iyiib uwa idiọọkñkpọ ado ke mben akpokoro uwa; amaama anye aduọk se isʌhọ ke isọñ akpokoro uwa. Ami ado uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Aku ndin ayaawa anye ako nte ufọfọb uwa naña mbed atemme, anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ anye ke idiọọkñkpọ a-anye akenamma, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />“ ‘Akpedo anam anye inieghe ibiom iba me ñyịn abomoñkuku iba, yak anye adat eti ndomuyo mbaak keed ke itie duob efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6</char></note> udomoñkpọ adi nte uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ amọ. Inaaha esịn adan ọlif me insensi ke esịd, sia ado uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Anye anie adiben nsọk aku; aku ndin ayaawoppo ndomuyo ado ubọk keed nte ñkpọ aditoiyo, anyʌñ afọp ke akpokoro uwa ke anyọñ uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ami ado uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ anye ke idiọọkñkpọ akeedodo a-anye anamma, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye. Mme enọ mbon se isʌhọ anie aku, ukem naña ado ke uwa ñkpasi.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ndudue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Ini a-awo ndomokeed imiinamma akpanikọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke adinam idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam ke abaña ndisana ñkpọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeedodo, anye anie adidat akukịmedọñ ke atu udịmedọñ i-imiinieghe ndo, a-anyʌññọ akem ekọmudua ke silfa, akeene ekọmudua sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 12</char></note> itieukpono ndi nte isob. Ami ado uwa ndudue. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Ana anye anọ usiene se anye atre adinam ke abaña ndisana ñkpọ, adian isob ke adikpe mbakka keed ke itie ition ekọmudua amọ, anyʌñ aben afịd ñkpọ ado anọ aku. Aku ayaaben akukịmedọñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ anye nte uwa ndudue, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Adieke awo adueghe, anyʌñ anam ñkpọ akeedodo a-mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpanna, akpesʌkado a-anye imiidiọọñọke, anye a-adue isob, ndin ana anye akpe utịb. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Anye anie adisio akukịmedọñ i-imiinieghe ndo, a-anyʌññọ akem nnen-nnen ekọmudua ke atu udịmedọñ nte uwa ndudue adat asọk aku. Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ anye ke idiọọkñkpọ akeedodo a-anye akenamma ke unana adidiọọñọ, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Anye ado ado uwa ndudue, sia anye amaanam ndudue ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Lefitikọs 6:1-7 ewet Lefitikọs 5:20-26, ñko Lefitikọs 6:8-30 ewet Lefitikọs 6:1-23.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“Adieke awo anamma idiọọkñkpọ inyʌññọ inam akpanikọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ato ke adibiaña mbọhọidʌñ amọ ke abaña ñkpọ se ekenọọ anye nọ anịm me se ekenọọ ke ubiọñ, me ke abaña ñkpọ se ekeyịp, me adieke anye anamma ñwo ye mbọhọidʌñ amọ, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />me adieke anye akịtte ñkpọ se ikisop ndin akañ, me anwọñọ unwọñọ nsu abaña idiọọkñkpọ akeedodo a-awo anamma, <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />anye amaadue ke utọ usʌñ ami ndin akema edikịt ndudue amọ, ana anye aben se ekeyịp me se ekebọọ ke ñkanubọk, me se ekenọọ ebo enịm, me se ikisop nọ ekịt, atịmme adinọ, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />me ñkpọ keed akeedodo a-anye akenwọñọke unwọñọ nsu abaña. Ana akoono mme ñkpọ ado atịmme adinọ ayọhọ-ayọhọ, amaana adian mbaak keed ke itie ition ekọmudua ñkpọ ado ayaak afịd anọ andinie ke usen a-anye anọọhọ uwa ndudue. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Ñko nte uwa ndudue, ana anye adat akukịmedọñ ke atu udịmedọñ i-imiinieghe ndo, a-anyʌññọ anie nnen-nnen ekọmudua, asọk aku, ado ado, adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk inọ anye ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin eyaefeen enọ anye ke mme ñkpọ akeedodo a-anye akenamma nte ndudue.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufọfọb Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Nọ Erọn ye nditọ amọ mbed ami: ‘Mme ewʌhọ ufọfọb uwa ado ami: Ufọfọb uwa ana adoro ke ebʌkikañ akpokoro uwa afịd akonayio, tutu ayio asiere, ñko ana ikañ asak ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Aku ndin ayaasịne linen afọñ amọ, ye linen afọñ idakidem ke esịd, ndin asio ntọñ ufọfọb uwa i-ikañ amaaketa ke akpokoro uwa anịm ke mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Amaama ado ana anye asio afọñ mbon ado ke idem anyʌñ aben mfen asịne, ndin anye aben ntọñ ado awuọ ke itie nnaa akaa itie se isana. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Ana ikañ ke akpokoro uwa asʌk asasak; inaaha anịme. Kwa ubakusen aku ana adisịn ifia anyʌñ aneeñe ñkpọ ufọfọb uwa adoot ke ikañ anyʌñ afọp akpọñ uwa ewuana adot ke anyọñ ado. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Ana ikañ ke akpokoro uwa akaka iso asak; inaaha anịme.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ñkpasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“ ‘Mme ewʌhọ uwa ñkpasi ado ami: Nditọ Erọn ana eben enọ edi iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke iso akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Aku anie adiwoppo ataa eti ndomuyo se inekke ifọn ye adan ọlif, adian ye afịd insensi ke uwa ñkpasi, ndin afọp nte ñkpọ aditoiyo ke akpokoro uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte anemufịk uwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Erọn ye nditọ amọ eyaedia se isʌhọ, ado enie edidia uyo se yiis imiisịneke, enyʌñ etie ke esịd itieukpono ke ini ediaha anye; enie edidia anye ke akwere atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Inaaha esịn yiis esañ anye; ami mmenọ ammọ anye ado nte udeeme ammọ ke uwa ndidia se edat ensọk. Ado adisana, ukem nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko Lefitikọs 6:25, 30</char></note> ye uwa ndudue. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Afịd nditọ ideen ke ubon Erọn ekeme edidia anye. Ke afịd emana, anye ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ udeeme uwa ndidia amọ a-atooho ke se edat esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Se adodo a-atuuho ammọ ayaakappa ado adisana.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamaana abo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Uwa se Erọn ye nditọ amọ ediiben isọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke usen se ediiyet anye adan ado ami: ataa eti ndomuyo, mbakka amọ keed ke itie duob ke udomoñkpọ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6</char></note> nte uwa ñkpasi e-enamma ke ini ke ini, ubaak keed ubakusen ye ubaak keed ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Ana esịn adan ke esịd usan ukwak esañ anye; eyaenekke ewuak anye afọn enyʌñ ebʌñ anye ñkeñe-ñkeñe eben edinọ nte anemufịk uwa a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Ayịn awodeen amọ adiidat itie amọ nte aku eyette adan adiinam ñkpọ ami. Ado udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ndin ana efọp anye afịd-afịd. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Ana efọp afịd uwa ñkpasi aku afịd-afịd; inaaha edia anye.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ufeen Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Dọkkọ Erọn ye nditọ amọ ate: ‘Mme mbed e-ebañake uwa idiọọkñkpọ ado ami: Ana ewot uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke itie e-ewotto ufọfọb uwa; anye ado ataa adisana. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Aku a-anamma uwa ami adiidia anye; ana edia anye ke itieukpono, ke akwere atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Se adodo atuuhọ abʌk amọ ayaakappa ado adisana, ndin iyiib ado akpetiamma ke nsiine, ana eyet anye ke akwere itieukpono. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Ana ebom ako usiọñ ekedatta etem unam ado; ado akpedo ekekama ako brọns etem, yak etʌk anye enyʌñ edaara ke mmọọñ. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Awodeen akeedodo ke ubon aku akeme adidia; anye ado ataa adisana ñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Ado inaaha eta uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed e-ebenne iyiib amọ edʌk atayad mbono adinam ñkpeubọk ke Adisana Itie; ana efọp anye esio.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ndudue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />“ ‘Mme ewʌhọ uwa ndudue edo ami, a-adooho ataa adisana: <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Yak ewot uwa ndudue ke itie e-ewotto ufọfọb uwa, ndin enie ediben iyiib amọ nsiime ñkanna ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Eyaeben afịd akpọñ amọ enọ nte uwa: akpọñ isịm ye akpọñ a-afʌkkọ mme ñkpọ esịd idịb, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />naña ekpuud iba ye akpọñ a-adianake ye ammọ, a-akpereke isịn, ye anyan udʌk a-ayịreke ke ati, a-anaaha esio keed ye mme ekpuud ado. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Aku ayaafọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa nte uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ado uwa ndudue. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Awodeen akeedodo ke ubon aku akeme adidia, ado ana edia ke akwere itieukpono; ado ataa adisana.<verse eid="LEV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />“ ‘Ewʌhọ uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 7:37</char></note> ye ake uwa ndudue edo ukem-ukem: Mme enọ ado enie aku a-abenne ammọ anam ñkpeubọk. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Aku a-anamma ufọfọb uwa anọ awo akeme adisio ikpa unam uwa ado anịm anọ idem amọ. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Afịd uwa ñkpasi e-esañña ke usaññkpọ ndomuyo, me anye etemme ke ako, me ke ukwak, anie aku a-anamma uwa ado, <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />ndin afịd uwa ñkpasi, me ewuak adan ọlif me awo iwuaha, anie nditọ Erọn.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa Ewuana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />“ ‘Mme ewʌhọ uwa ewuana a-awo akemeke adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado ami:<verse eid="LEV 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />“ ‘Ammọ ekpenọ anye nte uwa ekọọm, yak edian mme uyo se idoppo, a-awo imiisịnne yiis ado ewuak adan, mfefeere uyo se yiis imiisịneke ado efiọññọ adan, ye ndodoppo uyo edatta ataa eti ndomuyo enam, ewuak adan ke esịd. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Ñko yak edian uwa asañake ye ndodoppo uyo esịnne yiis ke uwa ewuana ekọọm ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Ammọ enie edidat keedekeed ke atu mme ñkpọ uwa ado ndi, nte anye etịppe enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; anye ado anie aku a-asiimeke iyiib uwa ewuana ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Ana eta unam uwa ewuana ekọọm kpa usen e-ewaaha anye. Inaaha enịm unam nọ ayio asiere.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“ ‘Ado adieke uwa ammọ adooho akaaña me enọ imaesịd, eyaedia uwa ado ke usen e-ewaaha anye, ado ekeme edidia se isʌhọ edem usen. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Ana efọp unam uwa a-anaaha awuọ usen ita. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Ekpeta unam uwa ewuana ado ke ayọhọ usen ita, awo idiinyịmmeke andikinọọ uwa ado. Awo idiinyʌññọ ibat inọ ammọ, sia akappa ndedeghe ñkpọ; awo a-adiaha anye adiibọ ufen idem amọ.<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />“ ‘Inaaha eta unam ndomokeed atuuhọ ñkpọ se imiisanake; ana efọp anye esio. Amaado mme unam mfen, awo akeedodo a-asanake akeme adita. <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Ado adieke awo ndomokeed i-imiisanake ataaha unam uwa ewuana a-anieghe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana esio ammọ efep ke atu mbon ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ ñkpọ se imiisanake me ado awo se imiisanake me ado unam se imiisanake me ado ñkpọ ndomokeed se isaña ke isọñ imiisanake, ndin adita unam uwa ewuana a-anieghe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana esio utọ awo ado efep ke atu mbon ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enọ Ikpan Ebaña Adidia Akpọñ ye Iyiib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Ikiita akpọñ unam enañ me ake edọñ me ake ebod. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Ekeme edidat akpọñ ñkpaikpa unam me anye se unam ikọd awot nnam ñkpọ ndomokeed mfen, ado inaaha ndufo eta anye. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Ana esio awo akeedodo a-ataaha akpọñ unam edatta enam uwa ndidia enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> efep ke atu mbon ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Ndin nte ndufo edọdʌñ, inaaha ndufo edia iyiib inuen me ake unam ndomokeed. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Awo ndomokeed a-adiaha iyiib, ana ewot anye esio ke atu mbon ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Mme Aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Awo a-adatta uwa ewuana asọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anie adiben ubaak ndi nte uwa a-anye anọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Anye anie adidat ubọk amọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> uwa ndidia ado; anie adidat akpọñ ye ikọñesịd ndi, ndin efʌñ ikọñesịd ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Aku ayaafọp akpọñ ado ke akpokoro uwa, ado ikọñesịd anie Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Enie edinọ aku ifʌkkọ nnasia uwa ewuana ndufo nte etịbe. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Ayịn awodeen Erọn a-awaaha iyiib ye akpọñ uwa ewuana adiinie ifʌkkọ nnasia nte udeeme amọ. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Ke atu mme enọ ewuana nditọ Isrel, ami mmesio ikọñesịd e-efʌññọ ye ifʌkkọ uwa ewuana a-nditọ Isrel edatta ediyaak enọ Erọn aku ye nditọ ideen amọ nte ewʌhọ nsi-nsi udeeme ammọ a-atooho nditọ Isrel.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Ami ado udeeme uwa ndidia ekenọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ekediannake enọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ke usen ekemekke ammọ edinam ñkpọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte mme aku. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Usen e-ekeyette ammọ adan, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ uyio ate nditọ Isrel enọ ammọ ñkpọ ami nte nsi-nsi udeeme ammọ ke afịd emana.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Ami ado mme ewʌhọ ufọfọb uwa, uwa ñkpasi, uwa idiọọkñkpọ, uwa ndudue, uwa udodubọk ye uwa ewuana, <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses ke Abod Sainai ke Akpautatan Sainai ke usen a-anye akenọọhọ nditọ Isrel uyio ate eben mme uwa ammọ esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Udodubọk Erọn ye Nditọ Ideen Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Ben Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen, nsiine ammọ, adan udodubọk, ayaaraenañ uwa idiọọkñkpọ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 8:14</char></note> akukịmedọñ iba ye akpasa a-adọñọke uyo se yiis imiisịneke, <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />nyʌñ koono afịd esob bok ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Moses amaanam naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio, ndin mbon esob emaeboho ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono.<verse eid="LEV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Moses amaabo esob ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ uyio abo yak enam ado ami.” <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Ndin Moses amaasio Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ adi anyʌñ ayet ammọ ke mmọọñ. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Anye amaaben tunik asịn Erọn, abọp anye ubọbisịn, asịn anye afọñidem, anyʌñ aben afọñ aboditọñ akọọñ anye. Anye ñko amaaben uyaiya mbọbọisịn akpaha adian ke aboditọñ abọp anye. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Anye amaaben mbana ikpanesịd akọọñ anye anyʌñ asịn Urim ye Tumịm ke mbana ikpanesịd ado. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Ndin anye amaaben afọñiwuod adot Erọn ke iwuod, ndin ke iso afọñiwuod ado anye amaadian usan kold, a-adooho adisana idiọọñọ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo Moses anam.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Ndin Moses amaaben adan unịm idiọọñọ anyʌñ ayeet ke tabanakịd ye ke afịd ñkpọ se idọñọ ke esịd, anyʌñ anam ammọ esana. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Anye amaasiime ibio adan ado ke akpokoro uwa akañ itiaba, anyʌñ ayet ke akpokoro uwa ye afịd ñkpoduoho amọ, ye besịn ye ukod amọ, adinam ammọ esana. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Anye amaaben ubaak adan unịm idiọọñọ ado aduọk Erọn ke iwuod, ayet anye nọ anam anye ado adisana. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Ndin anye amaasịññe nditọ ideen Erọn adi, asiin ammọ tunik, abọọp ammọ mbọbọisịn anyʌñ aben itam ayaat ammọ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Ndin anye amaadat ayaaraenañ uwa idiọọkñkpọ adi, ndin Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ emaedot anye ubọk ke iwuod. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Moses amaawot ayaara enañ ado, ndin adat iyiib ado ke nnuunubọk amọ ayeet ke afịd nnʌk akpokoro uwa nọ anam akpokoro uwa asana. Anye amaanwañña iyiib se ikisʌhọ aduọk ke isọñ akpokoro uwa. Ke ntoro anye amaanam anye ado adisana nọ ato do anam ñkpeubọk anọ itie ado. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Moses amaanyʌñ asio afịd mme akpọñ e-edianake ke mme ndido esịd idịb, anyan nsia ikọñesịd ye atiesịd, ye mme ekpuud iba ado ye akpọñ ammọ, anyʌñ afọp ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Ado ayaaraenañ ado ye ikpa amọ ye abʌkunam ye nsia anye amaafọp ke esiin itie nnaa, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Ndin anye amaaben akukịmedọñ ufọfọb uwa adi, ndin Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ emaedot anye ubọk ke iwuod. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Ndin Moses amaawot akukịmedọñ ado anyʌñ asiime iyiib amọ akanna mme mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Moses amaakpok akukịmedọñ ado mbai-mbai anyʌñ afọp iwuod, mme mbai amọ ye akpọñ. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Anye amaayet ñkpọ esịd idịb ye ukod ke mmọọñ anyʌñ afọp afịd akukịmedọñ ado ke akpokoro uwa. Anye akedo ufọfọb uwa, anemufịk, uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Anye ndin amaaben akukịmedọñ anye ako adi, akukịmedọñ udodubọk, ndin Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ emaedot anye ubọk ke iwuod. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Moses amaawot akukịmedọñ ado anyʌñ adat ubaak iyiib ado atọi Erọn ke mben utọñ nnasia, ke akpan nnuunubọk nnasia ye ke ekamba nnuunukod nnasia. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Ñko Moses amaasịññe nditọ ideen Erọn adi anyʌñ atọi ammọ ubaak iyiib ado ke mben utọñ nnasia ammọ, ke akpan nnuun ubọk nnasia ye ke ekamba nnuun ukod nnasia ammọ. Ndin anye amaasiime iyiib ado akanna akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Ke amaakema ado, anye amaasio akpọñ, isịm, afịd akpọñ a-adianake ke ñkpọ esịd idịb, anyan udʌk a-ayịreke ke ati, mme ekpuud iba ado ye akpọñ ammọ ye ifʌkkọ nnasia. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Ndin anye amaasio ndodoppo uyo keed, ndodoppo uyo keed ewuaha adan ọlif, ye mfefeere uyo keed ke akpasa uyo se yiis imiisịneke, a-akenaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin anye amaaben ammọ adot ke mme akpọñ ye ke ifʌkkọ nnasia. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Anye amaaben afịd ami asịn Erọn ye nditọ amọ ke ubọk, ndin ammọ emaekama efʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Ndin Moses amaabọi ammọ mme ñkpọ ado anyʌñ afọp ke akpokoro uwa ke anyọñ ufọfọb uwa nte uwa udodubọk mme aku, anemufịk, uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Moses ñko amaaben ikọñesịd, a-akedooho udeeme amọ ke akukịmedọñ udodubọk mme aku, anyʌñ afʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewuuk Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Ndin Moses amaadat ubaak adan udodubọk ye ubaak iyiib ke akpokoro uwa asiime Erọn ye nsiine amọ anyʌñ asiime nditọ ideen amọ ye nsiine ammọ. Ke ntoro anye amaanam Erọn ye nsiine amọ ado adisana, ñko nditọ Erọn ye nsiine ammọ ado adisana.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Ndin Moses amaabo Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ate, “Item unam ado ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono inyʌñ ita anye ke ndo ye uyo a-atooho akpasa enọ udodubọk mme aku, naña ekennọọ ewʌhọ: ‘Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ enie edita anye.’ <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Ndin ifọp unam ye uyo se isʌhọ. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Ikiinyʌñ idaaña ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono ke idak usen itiaba, tutu usen udodubọk ndufo akweeñe, sia udodubọk ndufo adiidat usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Se enam mfịn ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio, nọ ato do enam ñkpeubọk inọ ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Ana eba ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono uweemeayio ye akonayio ke usen itiaba enyʌñ enam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayem, mbaak ndufo idikpa; sia ewʌhọ se ekennọọ ado ado.”<verse eid="LEV 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Ke ntoro Erọn ye nditọ amọ emaenam afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeboiyo ke Moses atañ.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Aku Etọọñọ Utom Ammọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Akema ke ayọhọ usen itiaita Moses amaakoot Erọn ye nditọ amọ ye mme ñkpisọñ Isrel. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Anye amaabo Erọn ate, “Dat ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed nte ñkpọ uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana</char></note> mfo ye akukịmedọñ keed nte ufọfọb uwa mfo, naña iba inaaha enie ndo, ndin ben ammọ di ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Ndin dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Idat akpoebod keed nte ñkpọ uwa idiọọkñkpọ, ñyịn enañ keed ye ñyịn edọñ keed, yak ammọ mba eyọhọ isua keed, inyʌññọ inie ndo, nte ñkpọ ufọfọb uwa <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />ye abaakenañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru, akeme ido ayaara me uman </char></note> keed ye akukịmedọñ keed nte ñkpọ uwa ewuana adidiwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, dian ye uwa ñkpasi ewuaha adan ọlif. Sia mfịn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaiwọt ndufo idem.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Ammọ emaeben afịd se Moses akebo ammọ ekaa ke iso atayad mbono, ndin afịd esob emaesịkke ekpere edida ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Ndin Moses amaabo, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ndufo enam ado ami, nọ ato do ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iwọt ndufo idem.”<verse eid="LEV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Moses amaabo Erọn ate, “Di akpokoro uwa diwa uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ ye ufọfọb uwa mfo nyʌñ nam ñkpeubọk nọ idem mfo ye atu awo; wa uwa nọ atu awo nyʌñ nam ñkpeubọk nọ ammọ, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Ndin Erọn amaadi akpokoro uwa akewot ñyịn enañ nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ anọ idem amọ. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Nditọ ideen Erọn emaeben iyiib ado esọk anye, ndin anye amaadeep nnuunubọk amọ anyʌñ aben ayeet ke mme nnʌk ke akpokoro uwa, anye amaaben ñyọhọnsʌhọ iyiib ado aduọk ke isọñ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Ke akpokoro uwa anye amaafọp akpọñ, mme ekpuud ye udʌk ayịreke ke ati a-atooho uwa idiọọkñkpọ, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewuuk Moses; <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />anye amaafọp abʌk ye ikpa unam ke esiin itie nnaa.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Ndin Erọn amaawot ufọfọb uwa. Nditọ ideen amọ emaeben iyiib ado enọ anye, anye amaanyʌñ aben asiime ke mme mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Ammọ emaeben ufọfọb uwa esọk anye mbai ke mbai, ye iwuod, ndin anye amaafọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Anye amaayet ñkpọ esịd idịb ye ukod anyʌñ afọp ammọ ke anyọñ ufọfọb uwa ke akpokoro uwa.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Ndin Erọn amaaben uwa mbon awo adi. Anye amaaben akpoebod uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ mbon awo awot anyʌñ awa anye nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ naña anye akenam ye akpa ado.<verse eid="LEV 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Anye amaaben ufọfọb uwa adi anyʌñ adiwa naña mbed aketemme. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Anye amaanyʌñ aben uwa ñkpasi adi, amaawoppo ekpaubọk keed anyʌñ afọp ke akpokoro uwa adian ye ufọfọb uwa ubakusen.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Anye amaawot ayaaraenañ ye akukịmedọñ nte uwa ewuana anọ atu awo. Nditọ ideen Erọn emaeben iyiib ado enọ anye, ndin anye amaasiime anye ke mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Ado akpọñ abaakenañ ye ake akukịmedọñ, akpọñ isịm, ekamba akpọñ, ekpuud ye udʌk ayịreke ke ati, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />ammọ emaekoono mbon ami edoot ke ikọñesịd, ndin Erọn amaafọp akpọñ ado ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Erọn amaafʌñ ikọñesịd ye ifʌkkọ nnasia ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa, naña Moses aketemme.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Ndin Erọn amaabenne ubọk amọ ke anyọñ anyʌñ adiọñ atu awo. Ke anye amaakewa uwa idiọọkñkpọ, ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ewuana, anye amaasọiyọ.<verse eid="LEV 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Ndin Moses ye Erọn emaedʌk esịd atayad mbono. Ammọ ekewuọ edi, emaediọñ atu awo; ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawuọ awọt afịd atu awo idem. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Ikañ amaato ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awuọ anyʌñ ata ufọfọb uwa ye akpọñ ke akpokoro uwa. Ke ini afịd atu awo ekekịtte ami, ammọ emaesio ñkpo idaara enyʌñ eduọ ekʌp iso ke isọñ.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Nadab ye Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Akema nditọ ideen Erọn, Nadab ye Abihu, emaeben ñkpọ ufọp insensi ammọ, esịn ikañ ke esịd enyʌñ edọñ insensi; ndin emaeben ikañ a-mmiikinieghe unyịmme edi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ñkpọ a-adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikiibooho enam. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Ndin ikañ amaato iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awuọ anyʌñ ata ammọ, ammọ emaekpañña ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Ndin Moses amaabo Erọn ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ abaña ado ami ke ini anye akebooho ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LEV 10:3">“ ‘Ke atu mbon e-esañake eñkpere miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LEV 10:3">ñyaawọt idem mmi nte adisana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LEV 10:3">ke iso afịd awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LEV 10:3">eyaeñkpono miin.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LEV 10:3">Erọn ikisioho uyio.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Moses amaakoot Miseel ye Elsafan, nditọ ideen Usiel, ayịneka ete Erọn, anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Idi mi; iben nditọete ndufo ami isio ke itie nnaa, isio ke iso adisana itieukpono.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Ndin ammọ emaedi ediben ammọ esio, naña ekenyʌñ esịne tunik ammọ, ewuọ ke itie nnaa, naña Moses akewuuk.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Ndin Moses amaabo Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ Eliasa ye Itama ate, “Ikiiyak ided ndufo asuakka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ikiinịm iwuod ndufo inwañ</char></note> ikiinyʌñ iwai afọñidem ndufo, imiidooho ntoro eyaekpañña ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayat esịd ye afịd abio. Ado nditọete ndufo, afịd Isrel ekeme adifʌhọ mbaña mbon ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asoboke ke ikañ. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Ikiidakka ikpọñ inuausʌñ atayad mbono imiidooho ntoro eyaekpañña, sia adan unịm idiọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọ ke idem ndufo.” Ndin ammọ emaenam naña Moses aketemme.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Erọn ate, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Afo ye nditọ mfo inaaha enwọñ ukọd me ndañ ukọd ini akeedodo a-ndufo edʌkkọ atayad mbono, imiidooho ntoro ndufo eyaekpañña. Ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana, <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />nọ ato do afo akan akịt ukpʌhọde a-abaaha ke ufọọd mbon se isana ye mbon mfen, ke ufọọd se ideghe ye se isana, <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />ñko mbaak afo akan akpeep nditọ Isrel afịd ewʌhọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aboiyo ke Moses anọ ammọ.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Moses amaabo Erọn ye Eliasa ye Itama, nditọ amọ se ikisʌhọ, ate, “Dat uwa ñkpasi a-asʌhọke ke atu uwa ndidia a-adooho akenam awo isịnne yiis, e-ekenọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, inyʌñ idia anye ke mben akpokoro uwa, sia anye ado ataa adisana. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Idia anye ikpere itieukpono, sia ado udeeme ndufo ye ake nditọ ndufo ke uwa ndidia ekenọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; sia ewʌhọ ekeñwuuhọ ado ado. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Ado afo ye nditọ ideen ye ibaan mfo emekeme edita ikọñesịd ekefʌññọ ye ifʌkkọ se ekenọọ. Idia ke itie se isana; unọ fiin ye nditọ mfo mbon ado nte udeeme uwa ewuana nditọ Isrel <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ewʌhọ. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Ana eben ifʌkkọ ekenọọhọ ye ikọñesịd ekefʌññọ edi ye akpọñ uwa ndidia, nọ efʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. Ami adiido nsi-nsi udeeme mfo ye nditọ mfo, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awuuk.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Ke ini Moses akebịppe abaña ebod uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 10:17, 19</char></note> ndin adidiọọñọ ke emaefọp, anye amaayat esịd ye Eliasa ye Itama, nditọ ideen Erọn se ikisʌhọ, amaanyʌñ abịp ate, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Ntaha a-ndufo imiikidiaha uwa adifeen idiọọkñkpọ ke nte akpere itieukpono-o? Anye ado ataa adisana; ekinọ ndufo nọ ato do esọọk ndudue abio efep ke ndufo edinam ñkpeubọk nnọọ ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Sia awo imiikibenne iyiib amọ idʌk Adisana Itie, akpekena eta ebod ado ekpere itieukpono, kpa naña ñkewuuk.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Erọn amaabọọrọ Moses ate, “Mfịn ammọ emaewa uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ ye ufọfọb uwa ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado utọ ñkpọ ntom adiñwuọñọ miin. Ado nte akpaakenem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd adieke ñkpekediaha uwa idiọọkñkpọ ado mfịn?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Ke Moses amaakekop ami, anye amaakop uyʌkkọ.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ndidia se Isana ye se Imiisanake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ate: <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Idọkkọ nditọ Isrel ibo: ‘Ke atu afịd unam se iba ke iso isọñ, mme unam se ndufo ekeme edita edo ami. <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Ndufo emekeme edita unam akeedodo a-ñkpad asakkake iba anyʌñ akọkkọ ñkpọ amaana ata.<verse eid="LEV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />“ ‘A-aba usʌk unam e-ekọkkọke ñkpọ emaana eben eta kpọd; ubaak enie ñkpad a-abakkake iba kpọd; ado inaaha ndufo eta ammọ. Akpesʌkado kamel akọkkọke ñkpọ amaana aben ata, ñkpad amọ ibakkake iba; anye isanake se ndufo eta. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Akukọñitiad, akpesʌkado anye akọkkọke ñkpọ amaana aben ata, ñkpad amọ ibakkake iba; isanake se ndufo eta. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Ekpumbakara, sia akpesʌkado anye akọkkọke ñkpọ amaana aben ata, ñkpad amọ ibakkake iba; isanake se ndufo eta. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Ñko, edi, akpesʌkado ñkpad amọ abakkake iba, anye ikọkkọke ñkpọ imaana iben ita; isanake se ndufo eta. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Inaaha ndufo eta unam amọ, me etuuk akpo amọ; anye ado ndedeghe ñkpọ inọ ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />“ ‘Ke atu afịd ñkpọ se idʌñọ ke mmọọñ, emekeme edita ñkpọ akeedodo se inie mba ye ikpọk. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Ado ñkpọ ndomokeed ke mme akpainyañ me ke mme idịm i-imiinieghe mba ye ikpọk, ke atu afịd se idọñọ iyọhọ mmọọñ me ke atu afịd aduuwem ñkpọ se isịne ke mmọọñ, ana edat ammọ nte se imiisanake <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />ndin sia ediisʌk ikaka iso idat ammọ nte se imiisanake, inaaha ndufo eta unam ammọ; ndin yak akpo ammọ ado ndedeghe ke iso ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Afịd ñkpọ ke mmọọñ se imiinieghe mba ye ikpọk, ndufo enie edikịt ammọ nte ndedeghe.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />“ ‘Mme inuen ami edo se ndufo ediidat nte se imiisanake. Inaaha ndufo eta ammọ sia ammọ edo ñkpọ ndek: ntrukpuum, utere, ikpañtana, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />ndad-ndad akukwọ, utọ abubịd akukwọ akeedodo; <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />ke utọ ke utọ ekọọñebʌkayob; <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />ñkịdikịd, ikpañinyañ, ke utọ ke utọ ndukpo; <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />etək ñkịdikịd, kọmoran, ekamba ñkịdikịd, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />afia ñkịdikịd, ñkịdikịd akpautatan, ọspri, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />stọk, utọ ikpañinyañ akeedodo, hupo ye ñkpekpem.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />“ ‘Afịd ñkeñe unam se inie mba ifuuro inyʌñ isaña ke ukod inaañ edo ndedeghe inọ ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Ado ke atu mme ñkeñe unam e-enieghe mba efuurọ enyʌñ esaña ke ukod inaañ, emekeme edita mbon u-ukod ammọ adianake keed ke anyọñ ñkpad, e-ekemeke aditatamma ke isọñ. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Ndufo emekeme adita afịd utọ ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ, katidịd, idiañ me ataktak. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Ado amaado afịd ñkeñe unam mfen se inie mba ifuuro inyʌñ isaña ke ukod inaañ, ndufo enie edikịt ammọ nte ndedeghe ñkpọ.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />“ ‘Mme ñkpọ ami adiinam ndufo edo ndedeghe; awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ akpo ammọ ndomokeed adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Ñko awo akeedodo a-abenne akpo ammọ ndomokeed ana ayet afọñ amọ anyʌñ ado ndedeghe tutu awuọ ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />“ ‘Afịd unam ake ñkpad imiibakkake iba, i-imiinyʌññọ ikọkkọ ñkpọ imaana ita, ado ndedeghe ñkpọ inọ ndufo; afịd awo se ituuk ammọ ediido ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Ke atu afịd mme unam se isaña ke ukod inaañ, mbon se isaña ke ekaubọk edo ndedeghe inọ ndufo; awo akeedodo atuuho akpo ammọ ndomokeed ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio, <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />ndin awo abenne akpo ammọ ana ayet afọñ amọ anyʌñ ado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“ ‘Ke atu afịd uwak ñkpọ se isaña ke isọñ, mbon ami edo ndedeghe inọ ndufo: ñkukwa, ekpu, utọ ke utọ akpọk, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />ukpọñayịn, ayaaraitaakpọk, akpọk, eduọnnduọn ye akube. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Afịd ami ado ndedeghe inọ ndufo ke atu afịd se isaña ke isọñ; awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ ndomokeed ke atu ammọ adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Adieke keed ke atu ammọ akpaaha ndin adiañña adiduọ adoro ke ñkpọ ndomokeed, se akpedodo e-ekamake ñkpọ ado enam, adiido ndedeghe, me ado eto, me ado afọñ, me ado ikpa, me ado ekpad. Ana enyiin anye ke mmọọñ, ndin anye ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio, ndin amaama anye ayaasana. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Ndin ammọ ndomokeed ekpeduọ edʌk ako usiọñ, afịd se idọñọ ke ako mbad usiọñ ado adiido ndedeghe, ndin ana ebom ako ado. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Ndidia ndomokeed se eyak ndufo edia amaatuuk utọ mmọọñ ado, ndidia ado ayaado ndedeghe; se enwọnwọñ akpesịne ke utọ ako ado adiido ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Afịd se akpo ammọ ado atuuk adiido ndedeghe; me ediok usaññkpọ me ako utemñkpọ; ana ebom ammọ; ammọ edo ndedeghe, ediinyʌñ ika iso ido ndedeghe inọ ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Ado idịm me ube udọñ mmọọñ ado se isana, ado awo ndomokeed se ituuk mme akpo ammọ ado ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Adieke akpo aduọhọ atuuk ñkpasi ndomokeed eyemme editọtọ, ñkpasi asʌk ado se isana. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Ado akpedo emaesịn mmọọñ ke ñkpasi ado nọ akpo unam aduọ atuuk anye, anye ado ndedeghe ñkpọ inọ ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“ ‘Adieke unam se enyịmme ebo nọ ndufo eta akpaaha, awo ndomokeed a-atuuhọ akpo amọ ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Mbon se ita akpo amọ eyaeyet afọñ ammọ enyʌñ edo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio; ñko mbon ebenne akpo ado eyaeyet afọñ ammọ enyʌñ edo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“ ‘Afịd se ekebot se inyọọn ke isọñ ado ñkpọ ndek; inaaha eta ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Se inyọọn ke idịb amọ, ye se isaña ke ukod inaañ, me se inie uwak-uwak ukod, inaaha eta, sia ado ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Ikiisappa idem ndufo ye mme utọ unam ndomokeed e-enyọọnọ; ikiisappa idem ndufo ye ammọ, ikiinyʌñ iyak nọ ammọ enam ndufo ekappa edo ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo; ke ntoro, inam idem ndufo asana, sia ami ndo adisana. Ikiisappa idem ndufo ye unam ndomokeed asañake ke isọñ. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akisioho ndufo ke isọñ Iyib adido Abasi inọọ ndufo; ke ntoro ana edo ndisana, sia ami ndo adisana.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“ ‘Ami ado mme mbed e-ebañake mme unam, ye inuen ye afịd aduuwem ñkpọ se isaña ke mmọọñ ye afịd ñkpọ se isaña ke isọñ. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Ana enam ukpʌhọde ke atu mme ñkpọ se ido ndedeghe ye se isana, ke atu mme aduuwem ñkpọ se ekeme adita ye se awo imiinaaha eta.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Unam Ibaan Esana ke Emaeman Ayịn Ema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Awonwaan a-ayommoke anyʌñ aman ayịn, anye ayaado se imiisanake ke usen itiaba, kpa naña anye imiisanake ke ini a-anye akịtte itieisọñ amọ. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita eyaefọọrọ ayịn awodeen ado edʌd. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Ini adinam awonwaan ado asana ke uwuọiyiib adiido usen edịb mme duob mme ita. Inaaha anye atuuk adisana ñkpọ ndomokeed, inyʌññọ ina anye akaa itieukpono tutu ini adinam anye asana akweeñe. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Adieke anye amanna ayịn awonwaan, ke udua iba, anye idiisanake, kpa naña ado ke ini a-anye anieghe itieisọñ amọ. Ndin ana anye abet usen ata mme itiokeed ndin anye asana ato uwuọiyiib amọ.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“ ‘Ke mme usen adinam anye asana me ado ayịn awodeen me ayịn awonwaan amaakweeñe, anye ana adat ñyịn edọñ isua keed adi adinọ aku ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono nte ufọfọb uwa, ye ñyịn abomoñkuku me ibiom nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 12:8</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Aku ayaawa uwa ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk ke iwuod amọ; ndin anye ayaasana ke uwuọiyiib amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 12:7">“ ‘Mme ewʌhọ a-anaaha anọ awonwaan a-amanna ayịn awodeen me ayịn awonwaan ado ami. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />Ado adieke anye imiikanna inọ ñyịn edọñ, yak anye adat ibiom iba, imiidooho anye adat ñyịn abomoñkuku iba adi, keed ado ake ufọfọb uwa, keed ado ake uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ; ndin aku ayaanam ñkpeubọk ke iwuod amọ, ndin anye ayaasana.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ewʌhọ E-ebañake Mme Ndiọi Udọñọ Ikpaidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ate, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Awo ndomokeed amaanie ndufuud me mfad me ndọdọnọ itie ke ikpaidem, a-adooho akeme adido idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ikọ adaaha anọ idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem ado akpamfia a-anyʌññọ ada anọ nsio-nsio udọñọ ke ikpaidem; ke ufañ ami ye ke nsio-nsio itie ke Lefitikọs 13:3-46</char></note> ana eben anye esọk aku Erọn, me ayịn awodeen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ubon</char></note> amọ keed a-adooho aku. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Aku anie adinekke nse inia ado ke ikpaidem, ndin adieke ided ke itie inia ado adooho afia, ñko inia ado atie nte adʌk anye esịd idem, ado idiọọk udọñọ. Ke aku amaase awo ado ama, anye ayaabo ke anye isanake. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Ndọdọnọ itie ado ke ikpaidem amọ akpedo afia ado itieghe nte adʌk esịd idem, ided ke ndo inyʌññọ ikappa afia, aku anie adisịn awo ado ke ekʌk ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba aku anie adimaana nse, ndin akpekịt ke udọñọ ado atuak ada, itarake isuana ke ikpọkidem, yak aku amaana akʌk anye usen itiaba mfen. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba yak aku amaana ase ammọ, ndin inia ado akpeniime, inyʌññọ itara isuana ke ikpọkidem, aku ayaabo ke ammọ esana; ñkaña mfad ke ado. Ana ammọ eyet afọñ ammọ, ndin eyaenyʌñ esana. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Ado mfad ado akpetara asuana ke ikpaidem ke ammọ emaekewọt aku idem nọ aku anọ uyio ke ammọ esana, ana ammọ emaana eka iso aku. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Aku anie adimaana nse awo ado, ndin mfad ado akpetara asuana ke ikpaidem, aku ayaabo ke anye ado ndedeghe; ado idiọọk udọñọ.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Awo amaanie udọñọ akpamfia, ana eben anye esọk aku. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Aku anie adise anye, ndin afia ndufuud akpeba ke ikpaidem awo ado, a-anamma nọ ided akappa afia ñko ndisi inia anyʌñ aba do, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />akaan udọñọ ikpaidem ke ado, ndin aku ayaabo ke awo ado isanake. Inaaha aku akʌk awo ado, sia anye amaadodo ndedeghe.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />“Udọñọ ado akpedʌk anye afịd ikpaidem ndin, nte aku akịtte, afʌk afịd idem awo udọñọ ado, tọọñọ ke iwuod tutu asịm ñkpad, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />aku ana ase ammọ, ndin udọñọ ado akpefʌk ammọ afịd idem, yak anye abo ke ammọ esana. Sia afịd akappa ado afia, ammọ esana. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Ado inia akpeba anye ke idem, anye adiido ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Aku amaakịt inia ado, yak anye abo ke anye ado ndedeghe. Inia ado ado ndedeghe; anie idiọọk udọñọ. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Inia ado akpemaana akappa afia, ana anye abịne aku. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Aku ana ase ammọ, ndin adieke adooho mme inia ado e-ekappa mfia, aku ayaabo ke awo ado asana; ndin ammọ eyaesana.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Awo amaanie ndufuud ke idem nọ ndufuud ado adikpa, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />ndin ke itie se ndufuud ado akeba, adiyọk anie afia me ndad-ndad afia ñkem, ana ammọ eben idem ammọ ekewọt aku. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Aku anie adise, ndin akpedʌk esịd idem nọ ided ke itie ado akappa afia, aku ayaabo ke awo ado ado ndedeghe. Ado udọñọ akpamfia atop awuọ ke itie ake ndufuud akebaaha. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Ado akpedo aku ase, afia ided ibaaha, ñko unan ado idʌkkọ esịd idem, ado atọọñọ adikpa, aku anie adikʌk anye usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Akpetara ke ikpaidem, aku ayaabo ke anye ado ndedeghe; ado idiọọk udọñọ. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Ado itie ado imiikpʌhọke, unan ado inyʌññọ itara, ado mbọn ndufuud ado aba, aku ayaabo ke ammọ esana.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Awo amaanie unan a-atooho ikañ ke idem nọ itie ado aba nte akpedaadat me akpefiafia awuọ ke anyen unan ikañ ado, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />aku ana ase itie ado, ndin adieke ided ke itie ado akappake afia, anyʌñ aba nte adʌk esịd idem, anye ado idiọọk udọñọ ikpọkidem atoppo awuọ ke itie unan ikañ ado. Aku ayaabo ke anye ado ndedeghe, anye ado udọñọ a-asappake ikpọkidem. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Ado adieke aku aseeghe unan ado ndin afia ided ibaaha ke anyen unan ado, ñko adieke unan ado imiidʌkkọ esịd idem ibọhọ ikpaidem, ado atọọñọ adikpa, aku ndin ayaasịn ammọ ke ekʌk ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba aku anie adise awo ado, ndin unan ado akpetara ke idem, aku ayaabo ke anye ado ndedeghe; ado idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Akpedo anam itie ado ikpəhoke inyʌññọ itara, ado aba nte a-akpa anyʌñ ayaaña, anye ado ado ndufuud a-atooho mbọn ikañ, aku ayaabo ke anye asana; ke mbọn ado ado mbọn ikañ.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Awodeen me awonwaan akpenie unan ke iwuod me ke ebek, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />aku ana ase unan ado, ndin akpedʌk esịd idem nọ ided ke itie ado ado uto-uto anyʌñ afefeere, aku anie adibo ke awo ado isanake; ado idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem ke iwuod me ke ebek. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Ado akpedo aku ase udọñọ ado anye idʌkkọ esịd idem, ñko abubịd ided ibaaha ke esịd, yak aku akʌk awo ado ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba aku anie adise inia ado, ndin akpedo anye itarake, uto-uto ided inyʌññọ isịne ke esịd, ndin itieghe nte anye a-adʌk esịd atəño akan ikpaidem, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />awodeen me awonwaan ado ana akwaat ided amọ, asʌhọ itie nte ñkpọ anam anye do, ndin aku anie adisịn ammọ ke ekʌk ke usen itiaba mfen. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba aku anie adise unan ado, ndin adieke anye imiitarake iyọhọ ikpaidem inyʌññọ idʌk esịd idem, aku ayaabo ke anye asana. Ana anye ayet afọñ amọ, ndin anye ayaasana. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Ado unan ado akpetara ayọhọ ikpaidem ke ini aku amaakebo ke ammọ esana, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />aku ana ase ammọ, ndin akpekịt abo ke unan ado atara adʌk idem, idooho se aku ada ayeem uto-uto ided; anye ado ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Akpedo, anam, inia ado aba nte ikpəhoke ke naña aku akonno akịt, ndin akpedo abubịd ided atịppe ke ndo, awo udọñọ ado abọ ukọk. Ammọ esana, ndin aku ayaabo ke ammọ esana.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Awodeen me awonwaan akpenie afia ñkem ke ikpaidem, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />aku anie adise ammọ, ndin ñkem ado akpeba ntọñ-ntọñ, ado ndiọñ awuọ anye ke idem, idooho idiọọk udọñọ; ammọ esana.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Awodeen i-ided amọ abegheke ke iwuod ndin anye anie ebọ, a-asana. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Akpedo ided akweeñe anye tọọñọ ke akpọiso ndin anye anie ebọ, anye asana. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Ado akpenie afia unan a-ayiibekeyiibe ke ebọ amọ me ke akpọiso, ado idiọọk udọñọ anam anye ke iwuod me ke akpọiso. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Aku ana ase anye, ndin unan ado ke iwuod amọ me ke akpọiso akpedo afia anyʌñ ayiibe nte idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />awodeen ado anie udọñọ anyʌñ ado ndedeghe. Aku ayaabo ke anye ado ndedeghe ke ntak unan ado ke iwuod amọ.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọ idiọọk udọñọ ado ana asịne ñwaiya afọñ, akama nsuakka ided,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">enịm iwuod ammọ inwañ</char></note> afʌk ñkpọ ke ebek amọ anyʌñ abọñ ñkpo abo, ‘Ndedeghe! Ndedeghe!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Adaña nte ammọ esʌkkọ enie udọñọ ado, ammọ ediisʌk ikakaiso edo ndedeghe. Ana ammọ edʌñ ikpọọñ; ana ammọ edʌñ ke edem nnaaekọñ.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ewʌhọ E-ebañake Nsiine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“Amaado nsiine a-abiarake ato idiọọk adifịt, afọñ idededọñ me afọñ linen, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />afọñ akeedodo e-edatta linen me idededọñ etuak me edọk, se utọ se utọ ikpa me se adodo e-edatta ikpa enam <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />itie ke nsiine ado, me ikpa, me afọñ etuakkatuak me edọkkọdọk, me ñkpọ akeedodo edatta ikpa enam, a-mbọn ado anaaha, akpedo awawa-awawa me ndad-ndad ndad-ndad, ado idiọọk mbọn, ndin ana ewọt aku. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Aku ana ase itie ado anyʌñ akpọnnọ nsiine ado anịm ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba aku ana ase mbọn ado, ndin adieke mbọn ntọrọibọ ado atarake ayọhọ ke afọñ ado, me afọñ etuakkatuak me anye edọkkọdọk, me ikpa, se adodo e-ekamake anye enam, mbọn ado ado idiọọk mbọn; ñkpọ ado ado ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Ana anye afọp afọñ ado, utuatuak me udọdọk afọñ idededọñ me linen, me ñkpọ akeedodo e-enamma ke ikpa a-amaakebiara, sia mbọn ado atara, ana efọp afọñ ado.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Ado akpedo aku adise mbọn ado itarake iyọhọ afọñ ado, utuatuak me ukekịm me udọdọk afọñ, me ñkpọ e-enamma ke ikpa, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />aku ayaanọ uyio ate eyet ñkpọ a-abiarake do. Ndin anye ayaamaana anịm anye usen itiaba mfen. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Emaeyet ñkpọ ado ema, aku ana amaana ase anye, ndin mbọn ado imiikpʌhọke iso, akpekọm anye imiitarake, ado ndedeghe. Ana efọp anye, adooho eti edem, anyʌññọ ado idiọọk edem, se ñkpọ ado akebiat. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Aku akpedise nọ ado ke mbọn ado akpa iso ke emaekeyet ñkpọ ado, anye anie adiwaak itie ado nsio ke afọñ ado, me itie ikpa, me itie utuatuak me udọdọk afọñ a-abiarake. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Ado ekpemaana ekịt anye ke afọñ ado, me ke utuatuak me udọdọk afọñ, me ke ñkpọ e-enamma ke ikpa do, anye ado mbọn a-atarake; ana efọp se adodo a-akamake mbọn ado. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Afọñ akeedodo, me utuatuak me udọdọk, me ñkpọ edatta ikpa enam, emaekeyet esio mbọn ado, ana emaana eyet. Idahado ndin ke anye adiisana.”<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Ami ado mme ewʌhọ a-abañake idiọọk mbọn ke nsiine idededọñ me ake linen, me ke utuatuak me ke udọdọk afọñ, me ke ñkpọ edatta ikpa enam, nọ ato do ebiere ebo ke ado nsasana me ndedeghe.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Adinam Mme Adọñọ Akpamfia Esana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Ami ado mme ewʌhọ anọ awo akeedodo a-adọñọke akpamfia ke ini adinam ammọ esana, ke ini emaeben ammọ ebịne aku. <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />Aku ana awuọ aka anwa itie nnaa akese ammọ. Adieke udọñọ ado akweeñeke ama,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ikọ adaaha anọ idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem ado akpamfia a-anyʌññọ ada anọ nsio-nsio udọñọ ke ikpaidem; ke ufañ ami ye ke nsio-nsio itie ke Lefitikọs 14:7, 32, 54, 57</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />aku ayaanọ uyio ate edat mme aduuwem inuen iba se isaana ye mme eto sida, iduod-iduod udʌkafọñ ye haisọb edinọ awo e-eyemme adinam asana. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Ndin aku ayaanọ uyio ate ewot keed ke atu inuen ado ke anyọñ eti mmọọñ a-asanake ke ako usiọñ. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Ndin anye ayaaben aduuwem inuen anye ako ye eto sida ye iduod-iduod udʌkafọñ ye haisọb anyiin ke iyiib inuen anye e-ekewotto do ke anyọñ eti mmọọñ a-asanake do. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Anye ayaaben asiime awo e-eyemme isio udọñọ akpamfia ke idem akañ itiaba, anyʌñ abo ke anye asana. Amaama ado, anye ayaasaana aduuwem inuen ado ayaak nọ anyọñ.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />“Awo e-eyemme adinam nọ asana ana ayet afọñ amọ, akwaat afịd ided amọ asio anyʌñ ayie idem ke mmọọñ; ndin ammọ eyaesana. Amaama ado ammọ e-ekeme edidʌk itie nnaa, ado ana ammọ eba ke esiin itie nnaa ammọ ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba ana ammọ ekwat afịd ided ammọ; ana ammọ ekwat ided iwuod ammọ, ñwaebek ammọ, ñwaanyen ye afịd ided ke idem ammọ. Ana ammọ eyet afọñ ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ammọ ke mmọọñ, ndin ammọ eyaesana.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />“Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ammọ ana edat ñyịn edọñ iba ye ñyịn umanedọñ isua keed se inana ndo, ye mbakka ita ke itie duob efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 5</char></note> ndomuyo se ifọn ikan, ewuaha ye adan ọlif enọ uwa ñkpasi, ye udomo iko adan keed.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita 0.3; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 14:12, 15, 21, 24</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Aku a-abooho ke ammọ esana, ayaaben awo ediinam asana ye mme ñkpọ uwa edinịm ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />“Ndin aku anie adisio keed ke atu ñyịn edọñ iba ado awa nte uwa ndudue, dian ye udomo iko adan keed ado; anye ayaafʌñ ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Anye anie adiwot ñyịn edọñ ado ke itieukpono e-esiwotto uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 14:19, 22, 31</char></note> ye ufọfọb uwa. Uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ anie aku, ukem nte uwa ndudue; anye ado ataa adisana. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Aku anie adiben usʌk iyiib uwa ndudue ado ayet ke mben utọñ nnasia awo ediinam asana, ke ekamba nnuunubọk nnasia ye ke ekamba nnuunukod nnasia amọ. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Aku ndin ayaadat usʌk adan ado atọkkọ asịn ke ekaubọk ufiin amọ, <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />aku adeep akpan nnuun ubọk nnasia amọ ke adan a-asịneke ke ekaubọk amọ, anyʌñ aben nnuunubọk ado asiime adan ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akañ itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Aku ayaaben adan ke ekaubọk amọ ayet ke mben utọñ nnasia awo ediinam asana, ke ekamba nnuunubọk nnasia ye ke ekamba nnuunukod nnasia, ke anyọñ iyiib uwa ndudue ado. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Aku ayaaben adan se isʌhọ anye ke ekaubọk ayeet awo ediinam asana ke iwuod anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk ke iwuod amọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Ndin aku ayaawa uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ awo e-eyemme isio ndedeghe ñkpọ ke idem ñnyʌñ nnam asana. Ke ado akweeñeke, aku ayaawot ufọfọb uwa <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />anyʌñ awa ke akpokoro uwa, adian ye uwa ñkpasi, anam ñkpeubọk anọ anye, ndin anye ayaasana.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Ado, adieke ammọ edooho uweene ndin inyʌññọ ikan inie mme ñkpọ ami, ana ammọ edat ñyịn edọñ keed edi nte uwa ndudue nọ eben efʌñ enam ñkpeubọk ke iwuod ammọ, ye efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6</char></note> ndomuyo mbaak keed ke itie duob se ifọn ñkan, ewuak ye adan ọlif nọ enam uwa ñkpasi, udomo iko adan keed, <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />ye ibiom iba me ñyịn abomoñkuku iba, keed ado ake uwa idiọọkñkpọ, anye ako ado ake ufọfọb uwa.<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />“Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ana ammọ eben mme ñkpọ ami esọk aku se ekama enam ammọ esana ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono, ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Aku anie adiben ñyịn edọñ uwa ndudue, ye adan ado, anyʌñ afʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Anye ayaawot ñyịn edọñ ado anọ uwa ndudue anyʌñ aben usʌk iyiib uwa ado ayet ke mben utọñ nnasia awo e-eyemme inam nọ asana, ke ekamba nnuun ubọk nnasia ye ke ekamba nnuun ukod nnasia amọ. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Aku anie aditọkkọ usʌk adan ado asịn ke ekaubọk ufiin amọ, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />ndin aku adeep nnuunubọk nnasia amọ ke adan a-asịneke ke ekaubọk amọ, anyʌñ aben nnuun ado asiime adan ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akañ itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Anye ayaaben ubaak adan se isʌhọ ke ekaubọk amọ ayet ke ukem itie a-anye akeyette iyiib uwa ndudue ke mben utọñ nnasia awo e-eyemme inam asana, ke ekamba nnuunubọk nnasia ye ke ekamba nnuunukod nnasia. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Aku ayaaben adan se isʌhọ ke ekaubọk amọ ayeet awo se eyem inam nọ asana ke iwuod anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk ke iwuod amọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Ndin anye ayaawa mme ibiom me mme ñyịn abomoñkuku, se awo ado akan anie, <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />keed nte uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ, anye ako nte ufọfọb uwa, adian ye uwa ñkpasi. Ntom ke aku adiinam ñkpeubọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọ awo e-eyemme inam asana.”<verse eid="LEV 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Mme ewʌhọ se ibaña awo akeedodo a-anieghe udọñọ akpamfia ado inieghe mme ñkpọ uwa se edat enam awo esana edo ami.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adisio Udọñọ A-atooho Ntọdibọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ate, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Ndufo emaedʌk isọñ Kenan, ake ami ñyemme adinọ ndufo nte udeeme ndufo, ndin ami nsịn mbọn ntọdibọ ke ufọk keed ke isọñ ado, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />andinie ufọk ado ana akedọkkọ aku abo, ‘Ami mmekịt ñkpọ ke ufọk mmi a-abaaha nte ntọdibọ.’ <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Aku ana anọ uyio ate esịññe afịd ñkpọ ke ufọk ado mbemiso anye akaa akese ntọdibọ ado, mbaak ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ufọk ado adido ndedeghe. Emaema ado, ana aku akese ufọk ado. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Anye ayaase me ntọdibọ ado mmọdo aba ke ndibene, ndin akpeba awawa-awawa me ndad-ndad ndad-ndad anyʌñ atʌñọ akan anyọñ ndibene, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />aku ayaawuọ ke esịd ufọk akesịm inuausʌñ ndin akọp usʌñ ufọk ado ke afịd usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba aku ayaatịmme akese ufọk ado. Ntọdibọ ado akpetara ke ndibene ufọk, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />aku ayaabo yak esịññe mme itiad a-antọdibọ adʌkkọ do eduọñọ ke ndedeghe itie ke edem abio. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Ana anye anam ekwat afịd ndibene esịd ufọk esio eben ekeduọñọ ke ndedeghe itie ke edem abio. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Ndin ana ekoono itiad mfen edọñ ke itie ammọ enyʌñ edat ufa aduañ eyọọñọ ufọk ado.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Ntọdibọ ado akpemaana asakka ke ufọk ado ke emaekesịññe mme ñkaan itiad idọñ ufa inyʌñ iyọọñọ, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />aku anie adika ñkese, ndin akpedo ntọdibọ ado a-atara ke ufọk ado, anye ado idiọọk mbọn ntọdibọ; ufọk ado ado ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Ana ewuut ufọk ado, mme itiad amọ, mme eto ye ntan ekoono esio ekeduọñọ ke ndedeghe itie ke edem abio.<verse eid="LEV 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />“Awo akeedodo a-adʌkkọ ufọk ado idaha emaekebet ufọk ado adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Awo a-anaaha ke ufọk ado me a-adiaha ñkpọ do ana ayet afọñ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Ado akpedo ke ini aku adiseeghe ufọk ado ntọdibọ ado itarake ke emaekeyọọñọ ufọk ima, anye ayaabo ke ufọk asana, sia udọñọ ntọdibọ ado akweeñe. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Nọ anye anam ufọk ado asana, aku anie adidat inuen iba ye eto sida, iduod-iduod udʌkafọñ ye haisọb. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Anye ayaawot inuen keed ke eti nsana mmọọñ ke ako usiọñ. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Ndin anye adiben eto sida, haisọb, iduod-iduod udʌkafọñ ye aduuwem inuen ado anyiin ke iyiib inuen e-ekewotto do ye ke eti nsasana mmọọñ, anyʌñ asiime ke ufọk ado akañ itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Anye ayaadat iyiib inuen ado, nsasana mmọọñ, aduuwem inuen, eto sida, haisọb ye iduod-iduod udʌkafọñ anam ufọk ado asana. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Amaama ado, anye anie adisaana aduuwem inuen ado ñyaak nọ anyọñ ke ikọd ke edem abio. Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke ediinam ñkpeubọk inọ ufọk ado ndin anye ayaasana.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Ami edo mme ewʌhọ afịd udọñọ ntọdibọ, ye inia, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />ye ake idiọọk udọñọ ke nsiine ye ke ufọk, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />ye ake ndufuud, ye mfad me ndọdọnọ itie ke idem, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />nọ ediọọñọ idaha se ñkpọ asana ye idaha se imiisanake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 14:57">Mme ewʌhọ udọñọ akpamfia a-abiatta awo ikpọkidem ye mme ñkpọ mfen ado ami.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Se Iwuọñọ Awo ke Idem A-anamma Awo Ado Ndedeghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ate, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Itañ ikọ ye nditọ Isrel inyʌñ ibo ammọ: ‘Ke ini atikwo-atikwo ñkpọ atooho esịd idem awodeen awuọ, utọ ñkpọ ado ado ndedeghe. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Me ñkpọ ado a-aka iso awuọ ke idem amọ me esiit anye, ado ayaanam anye ado ndedeghe. Naña se iwuọ anye ke idem adiidat ndedeghe idi ado ami:<verse eid="LEV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />“ ‘Ñkpana akeedodo u-utọ awo ado anaaha adiido ndedeghe, ndin se adodo a-anye atieghe adiido ndedeghe ñko. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Awo akeedodo atuuhọ ñkpana amọ ana ayet nsiine amọ anyʌñ ayie idem ke mmọọñ, ndin ayaado ndedeghe tutu asịm ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Awo akeedodo a-atieghe ke ñkpọ ndomokeed se awodeen a-ñkpọ awuọhọ ke idem aketieghe ana ayet nsiine ammọ anyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, ndin ammọ ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />“ ‘Awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ awodeen a-anieghe udọñọ ami ana ayet nsiine ammọ anyʌñ adat mmọọñ ayie idem, ndin ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />“ ‘Awo a-ñkpọ awuọhọ ke idem do akpekọkkọ etab atọ awo a-asanake, ana ammọ eyeet nsiine ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, enyʌñ edo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />“ ‘Afịd se awo ado adọọk atie ke ini anye awatta ke enañ adiido ndedeghe, <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />ñko awo atuuhọ ñkpọ akeedodo a-akebaaha ke idak awo ado, ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio; awo akeedodo a-akoonoke mme ñkpọ ado ana eyet nsiine ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, ndin ammọ ediido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />“ ‘Awo akeedodo a-awo udọñọ ado atuuhọ ke ini anye imiiyieghe ubọk ke mmọọñ ana eyeet nsiine ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, enyʌñ edo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />“ ‘Ana ebom ako mbad a-awo udọñọ ado atuuhọ, enyʌñ ekama mmọọñ edaara afịd ñkpọ e-ekamake eto enam.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />“ ‘Emaenam awo udọñọ ado asana, anye anie adibat usen itiaba nnọọ adisana amọ; ana anye ayet nsiine amọ anyʌñ ayie idem ke nsasana mmọọñ, ndin anye ayaasana. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ana anye adat ibiom iba me ñyịn abomoñkuku iba adi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono adinọ aku. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Aku anie adiwa ammọ, keed nte uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 15:30</char></note> keed nte ufọfọb uwa. Ke utọ usʌñ ami anye ayaanam ñkpeubọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ awo ado ke ntak se ikiwuọñọ anye ke idem.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />“ ‘Nsene amaawuọñọ awodeen ke idem, ana anye ayie afịd idem amọ ke mmọọñ, ñko anye adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Ana edat mmọọñ eyet nsiine me ikpa akeedodo a-nsene atuuhọ, ñko anye adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Awodeen amaanie ewuana ye awonwaan nọ nsene awuọñọ, ana ammọ awo iba eyie idem ke mmọọñ, ediinyʌñ ido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />“ ‘Awonwaan amaanie itieisọñ amọ, ndedeghe itieisọñ ado adiiwuọ usen itiaba, ndin awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ anye idiisanake tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />“ ‘Se adodo a-anye adọọhọ ana ke ini anye abaaha ke itieisọñ amọ adiido ndedeghe, ñko ñkpọ akeedodo a-anye atieghe adiido se imiisanake. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Awo atuuhọ ñkpana amọ ayaado ndedeghe; ana eyeet nsiine ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, eyaenyʌñ edo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ se anye atie ayaado ndedeghe; ana eyeet nsiine ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, eyaenyʌñ edo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Me ado ikʌk me ñkpọ mfen a-anye aketieghe, awo ndomokeed amaatuuk, ammọ eyaedo ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />“ ‘Awodeen akpenie ewuana ye anye nọ iyiib ado atuuk anye, anye ayaado ndedeghe ke usen itiaba; ikʌk a-anye anaaha adiido se imiisanake.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />“ ‘Iyiib amaawuọ awonwaan ke idem ke uwak usen ke ini imiidooho ini itieisọñ amọ, me usen awak akan naña akpenaa nte ado ke ini itieisọñ amọ, anye ayaado ndedeghe ke adaña ini a-anye anieghe uwuọiyiib ado, ukem nte ke ini itieisọñ amọ. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Ñkpana a-anye anaaha ke ini uwuọiyiib adiisʌk ido ndedeghe, kpa naña ado ke ini itieisọñ amọ, ndin se adodo a-anye anaaha ado ndedeghe, ukem nte ini itieisọñ amọ. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ ammọ adiido ndedeghe; ana eyeet nsiine ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, ammọ ediinyʌñ ido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />“ ‘Emaenam udọñọ ado akweeñe anye, ana anye abat usen itiaba asio, ndin ke ado amaaboiyo anye ayaasana. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ana anye adat ibiom iba me ñyịn abomoñkuku iba adinọ aku ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Aku anie adiwa keed nte uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ, keed nte ufọfọb uwa. Ke utọ usʌñ ami anye ayaanam ñkpeubọk anọ anye ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ndedeghe uwuọiyiib amọ.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“ ‘Ana ediañña nditọ Isrel ekpọñ mme ñkpọ se inam ammọ edo ndedeghe, mbaak ammọ edikpa ke ndedeghe ammọ ke edisappa itie idʌñ mmi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido tabanakịd mmi</char></note> a-abaaha ke atu ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Ami ado mme ewʌhọ a-anaaha anọ awodeen a-ñkpọ awuọhọ ke idem, ye awo akeedodo a-adegheke ato ke ntak utọk nsene, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />adooho awonwaan a-abaaha ke itieisọñ amọ, me awodeen me awonwaan a-ñkpọ awuọñọke ke idem, ye awodeen a-anieghe ewuana ye awonwaan a-adooho ndedeghe.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Usen Unam Ñkpeubọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ ye Moses ke ini nditọ Erọn iba ekesañake ekpere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> emaekekpañña. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: “Dọkkọ ayịneka mfo Erọn bo ke inaaha anye adʌk Ataa Adisana Itie ke edem afọñ inuausʌñ ke iso itie unam ñkpeubọk akedoroke ke anyọñ akebe edioomo ini ake anye amama, imiidooho ntoro anye ayaakpa. Sia ami ñyaawọt idem mmi ke ntọñanyọñ ke anyọñ itie unam ñkpeubọk.<verse eid="LEV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />“Naña Erọn adiisaña idʌk Ataa Adisana Itie ado ami: Ana anye abemiso adat ñyịn ayaaraenañ adi nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; ke ufañ ami ye ke afịd iwuod Ñwed ami</char></note> ye akukịmedọñ nte ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Anye anie adisịne tunik linen, ye afọñ idakidem linen; abọbọ mbọbọisịn linen anyʌñ ayara itam linen. Mbon ado edo ndisana nsiine; ke ntoro ana anye ayie idem ke mmọọñ mbemiso anye akoono mme nsiine ado asiine. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Yak anye adat akpoebod iba ke uwa idiọọkñkpọ ye akukịmedọñ keed ke ufọfọb uwa ato esob nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />“Erọn ana adat ayaaraenañ ado anam uwa ñkpeubọk anọ idem amọ ye afịd ufọk amọ. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Ndin anye ana aben akpoebod iba ado anịm ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Erọn ana asịn ukañ abaña akpoebod iba ado, ukañ keed anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, keed anie adiọọkukpọñaben (ebod uwa). <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Erọn ayaaben ebod awo u-ukañ atịppe anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiwa uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Ado amaado ebod u-ukañ atịppe ado adiọọkukpọñaben, eyaeben anye ye uwem enịm ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ edat enam ñkpeubọk ndin eben anye ñkesịn ke anaan.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />“Erọn ayaadat ayaaraenañ adi nte ñkpọ uwa idiọọkñkpọ amọ, adinam ñkpeubọk nnọọ idem amọ ye ufọk amọ, ndin anye ayaawot ayaaraenañ ado anam uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ anọ idem amọ. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Anye anie adiben ñkpọ ufọp insensi ke akpokoro uwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ayọhọ ukañ ke esịd, ye ayọhọ ubọk anem ufịk insensi iba emaekekọk nọ anekke adọnọ, aben mme ñkpọ ado akaa edem afọñ ikpeghe. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Anye ana adot insensi ado ke ikañ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin nsʌñikañ insensi ado ayaafʌk itie unam ñkpeubọk a-abaaha ke anyọñ itiad mbed edioomo, mbaak anye adikpa. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Anye ana adọppọ usʌk iyiib ayaaraenañ ado anyʌñ akama nnuun amọ asiime anye ke iso itie unam ñkpeubọk; ndin anye ayaadat nnuun amọ asiime usʌk iyiib ado ke itie unam ñkpeubọk akañ itiaba.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />“Anye ndin ayaawot ebod uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ mbon abio anyʌñ aben iyiib amọ akaa edem afọñ ikpeghe akenam naña ekenam ye iyiib ayaaraenañ. Anye ayaasiime iyiib ado ke itie unam ñkpeubọk ye ke iso itie unam ñkpeubọk. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Ke utọ usʌñ ami anye ayaanam ñkpeubọk anọ Ataa Adisana Itie ke abaña ndedeghe uwem ye nsọñiwuod nditọ Isrel, se ikpido idiọọkñkpọ se ammọ ekpekenanam. Anye ana anam ukem ado ye atayad mbono, a-abaaha ye ammọ ke ufọọd ndedeghe uwem ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Inaaha awo ndomokeed aba ke esịd atayad mbono ado tọọñọ ke ini Erọn adʌkkọ aka adinam ñkpeubọk ke Ataa Adisana Itie tutu anye awuọ adi, ke amaakenam ñkpeubọk anọ idem amọ, ufọk amọ ye afịd esob Isrel.<verse eid="LEV 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />“Ndin anye ayaawuọ akaa akpokoro uwa a-abaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam ñkpeubọk anọ anye. Anye ayaadat usʌk iyiib ayaaraenañ ye usʌk iyiib ebod ado atọi ke nnʌk akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Anye ayaadat nnuun amọ asiime usʌk iyiib ado akañ itiaba nọ anam anye asana anyʌñ adiañña anye asio akpọñ ndedeghe uwem nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />“Erọn amaanam ñkpeubọk anọ Ataa Adisana Itie, ye atayad mbono ye akpokoro uwa ima, anye ndin ayaaben aduuwem ebod ado adi. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Ndin Erọn ana aben naña ubọk amọ iba adot aduuwem ebod ado ke iwuod anyʌñ ayaara afịd ibak ye nsọñiwuod nditọ Isrel, afịd ndiọiñkpọ ammọ, anyʌñ ayaak ammọ adot ebod ado ke iwuod. Anye ayaasaana ebod ado ayaak asịn ke ubọk awo a-adaaha abet adinam utom ado abo aben anye aka anaan. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Ebod ado ayaabiom afịd ndiọiñkpọ ammọ akaa itie nte anyọọñ usʌñ; awo ado ayaanyʌñ asaana anye ayaak ke anaan ado.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Ndin Erọn anie adidʌk atayad mbono ñkesịññe mme nsiine linen a-anye akesịneke mbemiso anye akedʌk Ataa Adisana Itie, anyʌñ ayaak mme nsiine ado abono ke ndo. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Anye ayaayie idem ke mmọọñ ke adisana itie anyʌñ asịne mme afọñ a-anye asidakka asịne. Amaama ado anye ayaawuọ adi adiwa ufọfọb uwa ake idem amọ ye ufọfọb uwa mbon abio, nọ ato do anam ñkpeubọk anọ idem amọ ye mbon abio. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Anye ayaanyʌñ afọp akpọñ uwa idiọọkñkpọ ke akpokoro uwa.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />“Awodeen andisaana ebod ñyaak nte adiọọkukpọñaben ana ayet afọñ amọ anyʌñ ayie idem amọ ke mmọọñ; amaama ado anye akeme adidʌk nnaaekọñ. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Ñko ana eben ayaaraenañ ye ebod uwa idiọọkñkpọ, e-ekebenne iyiib ammọ edʌk Ataa Adisana Itie edinam ñkpeubọk, esio ke nnaaekọñ; enie edifọp ikpa ammọ, ye abʌk ammọ ye nsia ammọ ke ikañ. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Awo a-afọppọ ammọ ana ayet afọñ amọ anyʌñ ayie idem amọ ke mmọọñ; amaama ado anye akeme adidʌk nnaaekọñ.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Ami adiido nsi-nsi ewʌhọ inọ ndufo. Ke ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba ana ndufo enyịm idem ndufo ñkpọ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ana etie utreudia; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 16:31</char></note> inyʌññọ inam utom ndomokeed, me ado amanaisọñ me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo, <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />sia ke usen ami ke ediinam ñkpeubọk inọ ndufo, adinam ndufo esana. Ndin ndufo eyaesana ebọkkọ afịd idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Ado usen nduọkadudu sabad, ndin ana esuuhọ idem ndufo; ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Aku e-eyette adan enyʌñ edot anye ubọk adidat itie ete amọ nte ekamba aku anie adinam ñkpeubọk. Anye anie adisịne adisana nsiine linen <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ Ataa Adisana Itie, anam ñko anọ atayad mbono ye akpokoro uwa, ye mme aku ye afịd awo ke esob.<verse eid="LEV 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />“Ami adiido nsi-nsi ewʌhọ inọ ndufo. Enie edinam ñkpeubọk akañ keed ke isua nnọọ afịd idiọọkñkpọ nditọ Isrel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Ndin emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Moses.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ekpan Udia Iyiib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Dọkkọ Erọn ye nditọ amọ ye afịd mbon Isrel ate: ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo enam ado ami: <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Awo Isrel akeedodo a-awaaha abaakenañ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ayaara me uman</char></note> ñyịn edọñ me ebod ke nnaaekọñ me ke esiin nnaaekọñ <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />utu ke aben adi inuausʌñ atayad mbono adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte enọ ke iso tabanakịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, awo ado adue ke adiduọk iyiib; ammọ eduọk iyiib, ke ntoro ana ebịne utọ ibon ado esio ke atu mbon ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Ami ado adinam nọ nditọ Isrel edat mme uwa a-ammọ ewaaha ke inwañ edinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ana ammọ eben mme ñkpọ ado esọk aku, nọ ewa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono, nte mme uwa ewuana. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Aku anie adisiime iyiib ado ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono anyʌñ afọp akpọñ ado anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte anemufịk enọ. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Inaaha ammọ enam uwa ndomokeed mfen aba enọ mme ubobod ebod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido mme dimọn</char></note> a-ammọ eyakka idem ammọ enọ ke akpara. Ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ ammọ ye mme emana se idiidi.’<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />“Bo ammọ: ‘Awo akeedodo a-atooho ufọk Isrel me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ammọ, a-awaaha ufọfọb uwa me uwa mfen <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />ndin ibenne anye idi inuausʌñ atayad mbono idiwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana ewot anye esio ke atu ubon Isrel.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />“ ‘Ami ñyaawuuk iso mmi nse awo akeedodo a-atooho ufọk Isrel me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ammọ a-adiaha iyiib, ñyaanyʌñ ñkpịkke ammọ nsio ke atu mbon awo. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Sia uwem aduuwem ñkpọ se Abasi abot asịne ke iyiib, ndin ami mminọ ndufo nọ edat enam ñkpeubọk enọ idem ndufo ke akpokoro uwa; ado iyiib anam ñkpeubọk anọ uwem awo. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Ke ntoro ami mmebo nditọ Isrel nte, “Ke awo ndufo ndomokeed, me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo adia iyiib.”<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />“ ‘Awo Isrel ndomokeed me asenawo akeedodo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo adʌkkọ ikọd akemʌm unam me inuen ekemeke adita ana aduọk iyiib ado anyʌñ adat ntan afʌk, <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />sia uwem afịd unam ado iyiib amọ. Ntak ado anam yak ami mbo mbon Isrel nte, “Inaaha ndufo edia iyiib unam ndomokeed, sia uwem afịd unam ado iyiib amọ; ana ebịne awo akeedodo a-adiaha iyiib esio.”<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />“ ‘Awo akeedodo, me amanaisọñ me asenawo, a-ataaha ñkpaikpa ñkpọ me se unam ikọd awot ana ayet afọñ amọ anyʌñ ayie idem ke mmọọñ, ndin ammọ ediido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio; ndin ammọ eyaesana. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Ado adieke ammọ imiiyette afọñ ammọ inyʌñ iyie idem, ammọ ediibiom ukwaññkpọ ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Adinie Ewuana a-Mbed Akpanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“Tañ dọkkọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Inaaha ndufo enam naña enam ke isọñ Iyib a-ndufo ekesidʌññọ, inaaha enyʌñ enam naña mbon Kenan enam ke isọñ Kenan, a-ami ibenne ndufo ndʌk. Ikiikeene se ammọ enam. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Ana enịm mme mbed mmi enyʌñ ekpeme adisaña ke mme ewʌhọ mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Ndufo inịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed mmi, sia awo se inịm ammọ adiidu uwem akeene mme mbed ami. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“ ‘Inaaha awo ndomokeed anie ewuana ye ayakka amọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />“ ‘Kuusuenne ete mfo ke adinie ewuana ye eka mfo. Anye ado eka mfo; kuunie ewuana ye anye.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye anwaan ete mfo; ado ayaasuenne ete mfo.<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye ayịneka mfo awonwaan, me ado anye e-ete mfo abonno me anye e-eka mfo amanna, me anye akemana ke ukem ufọk keed ye afo me akemana ke itie mfen.<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye ayịn ayịn mfo awodeen me ye ayịn ayịn mfo awonwaan; ado adiido asuenne unọ fiin.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye ayịn anwaan ete mfo, emanna enọ ete mfo; anye ado ayịnete mfo awonwaan.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye ayịneka ete mfo awonwaan; anye ado ayakka ete mfo.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye ayịneka eka mfo awonwaan, sia anye ado ayakka eka mfo.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />“ ‘Kuusuenne ayịneka ete mfo awodeen ke adinie ewuana ye anwaan amọ; anye ado anwaan ayịneka ete mfo.<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye anwaan ayịn mfo. Ado anwaan ayịn mfo; kuunie ewuana ye anye.<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye anwaan ayịneka mfo; ado ayaasuenne ayịneka mfo.<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye eka ye ayịn amọ awonwaan. Kuunie ewuana ye ayịn awonwaan ayịn amọ awodeen me ye ayịn awonwaan ayịn amọ awonwaan; ammọ edoñño ayakka amọ. Ibak ado ado.<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />“ ‘Kuuben ayịneka anwaan mfo udọ nte anwaan ufịb unyʌñ unie ewuana ye anye ke ini anwaan mfo abaaha ke uwem.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />“ ‘Kuukeene awonwaan ke ini anye anieghe itieisọñ a-anamma anye isanake unyʌñ unie ewuana ye anye.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye anwaan mbọhọidʌñ mfo unyʌñ usappa idem mfo ye anye.<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />“ ‘Kuuben ayịn mfo ndomokeed unọọ nọ ewa uwa enọ Mọlek, sia inaaha asịn anyịñ Abasi mfo ke ndek. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye emọ-emọ awodeen nte naña awodeen anie ye awonwaan; anye ado ado ataa mbubiam adinam.<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye unam unyʌñ usappa idem mfo ye anye. Inaaha awonwaan aben idem amọ anọ unam nọ anie ewuana ye anye; ado ataa mbubiam adinam.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />“ ‘Ndufo ikiisappa idem ndufo ke mme utọ usʌñ ami, sia naña mme idịd a-ami mbooho mbịne nsio ke iso ndufo ekenam adodo esappa idem ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Emaesappa kpa isọñ ke idem amọ; anam ami mmaanọ isọñ ufen ke idiọọkñkpọ amọ, ndin isọñ amaakọk mme andidʌñ ke esịd asio. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Ado ana ndufo enịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed mmi. Inaaha mme amanaisọñ ye mme asenawo edʌñọ ke atu ndufo enam mme mbubiam ñkpọ ami ndomokeed, <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />sia mbon se ikibem ndufo iso idʌñ ke isọñ ami emaenam afịd mme ñkpọ ami, ndin ato ke ntak ado emaesappa isọñ. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Ndin ndufo ekpesappa isọñ, anye ayaikọk ndufo asio naña akekọk mme idịd ekedʌññọ mbemiso ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />“ ‘Afịd awo se inam mme mbubiam ñkpọ ami ndomokeed ana ebịne utọ mbon ado esio ke atu mbon abio ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Inịm mme ewʌhọ mmi, ikiinyʌñ ikeene mme mbubiam eduuwem e-ekebaaha ke isọñ ami mbemiso ndufo edi, ikiinyʌñ isappa idem ndufo ye ammọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Nsio-nsio Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />“Dọkkọ afịd esob nditọ Isrel ate: ‘Ndufo ido adisana sia ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi ndufo, ndo adisana.<verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />“ ‘Awo keedekeed ana akpono eka ye ete amọ, ana enyʌñ enịm mme Sabad mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“ ‘Ndufo ikiikeene mme ubobod abasi, ikiinyʌñ inam mme Abasi ukwak inọ idem ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“ ‘Ndufo imaiwa uwa ewuana inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, iwa anye ke usʌñ se adiinem nọ ebọ anye ke iwuod ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Ediidia anye kpa ke usen se ewa anye me ke edem usen; ana efọp se isʌhọ iwuọ ayọhọ usen ita. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Adieke ediaha anye ndomokeed ke ayọhọ usen ita, anye ado ndedeghe ndin awo idiibọọhọ. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Awo akeedodo a-adiaha anye ayaabiom ukwaññkpọ amọ sia ammọ ebiat se ido adisana inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ana ebịne ammọ esio ke atu mbon ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“ ‘Ke ini edọkkọ ñkpọ inwañ ndufo, ikiidọk ñkpọ se iba ke adaña inwañ, ikiinyʌñ ikoono se ibọkkọ iduọññọ ke isọñ ke ini edọkkọ. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Kuukịppe afịd mfịd ke inwañ fain mfo umaa, kuunyʌñ ukoono mfịd fain se iduọññọ ke isọñ. Kpọñ anye ado nọ mme uweene ye mme asenawo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“ ‘Kuuyịp inọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">“ ‘Kuusʌhọ nsu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">“ ‘Kuubiaña emọ-emọ.<verse eid="LEV 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />“ ‘Kuunwọñọ enwọñọ nsu ke anyịñ mmi unyʌñ ubiat anyịñ Abasi mfo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“ ‘Kuutʌk mbọhọidʌñ mfo, kuunyʌñ uyịp ñkpọ amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:13">“ ‘Kuunịm akʌk utom awo afo akpeeghe utom nọ ayio asiere.<verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />“ ‘Kuusueñ inan, kuunyʌñ unịm nnan ñkpọ iduọ ke iso, ado baak Abasi mfo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“ ‘Kuukpe ukwañ ikpe; kuutʌk uweene, kuunyʌñ uteeñe ekamba awo anyen, ado kpe ikpe mbọhọidʌñ mfo ke unen.<verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />“ ‘Kuusaña ubia mbia ke atu mbon ndufo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:16">“ ‘Kuunam ñkpọ ndomokeed a-akemeke adidat uwem mbọhọidʌñ mfo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“ ‘Kuusua emọ-emọ awo Isrel ndufo ndomokeed ke esịd mfo. Nekke sua nọ mbọhọidʌñ mfo mbaak afo udukeene uwuana ke ndudue ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />“ ‘Kuusio usiene, kuunyʌñ unie udu ubaña awo ndomokeed ke atu mbon ndufo, ado ma mbọhọidʌñ mfo nte idem mfo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“ ‘Inịm mme ewʌhọ mmi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">“ ‘Kuunam nọ utọ unam keed anie ewuana ye utọ unam mfen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">“ ‘Kuutọ utọ uduud ñkpasi iba ke inwañ mfo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">“ ‘Kuusịne nsiine e-edatta utọ afọñ iba ekịm.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“ ‘Awodeen akpenie ewuana ye afʌn awonwaan emaekenwọñọ adinọ awo mfen ke ndọ ado awo ifakkake anye diin inọ itie ayịn isọñ, ana enọ anye ufen a-adotto. Ado inaaha ewot ammọ, sia awonwaan ado imiidooho ayịn isọñ diin. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Kpayeado, ana awodeen ado aben akukịmedọñ adi ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono nọ edinam uwa ndudue enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Aku ana adat akukịmedọñ uwa ndudue ado anam ñkpeubọk anọ anye ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke abaña idiọọkñkpọ a-anye anamma, ndin eyaefeen idiọọkñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“ ‘Ke ini ndufo emaedʌk isọñ ado enyʌñ etọ eto mfịd akeedodo, idat mfịd amọ nte ñkpọ ebettebet.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru awuọñọ edʌd, isanake</char></note> Idat anye nte ñkpọ ibed.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru awuọñọ edʌd, isanake</char></note> Ke isua ita, inaaha edia anye. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Ke ayọhọ isua inaañ afịd mfịd amọ adiido adisana, edat anye enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ñkpọ itooro. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Ado ke ayọhọ isua ition emekeme edidia mfịd amọ. Ntom ke mbunwịm ndufo adiitọt inọ ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“ ‘Ikiita unam ndomokeed se iyiib asʌk aba anye ke idem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:26">“ ‘Ikiibre idiọñ, ikiinyʌñ iyem ñkukịd.<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />“ ‘Ikiifat ided ndufo inịm ekpəñ, ikiinyʌñ ifat mben ñwaebek ndufo isio.<verse eid="LEV 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />“ ‘Ikiikpi abʌkidem ndufo ke ntak akpañkpa, ikiinyʌñ iwet akukịn ke ikpaidem ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“ ‘Kuusuuhọ ayịn awonwaan mfo itie ke adinam nọ anye ado akpara, imiidooho ntoro isọñ ado ayaawọññọ abịne ido akpara, anyʌñ ayọhọ ye ibak.<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />“ ‘Inịm mme Sabad mmi inyʌñ iteeñe itieukpono mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“ ‘Ikiikaa useñkpọ, ikiinyʌñ ikeene mbiaidiọñ, mbaak ammọ edisappa ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“ ‘Umaukịd ekamba awo, dakka da, kpono mme ñkpisọñ nyʌñ baak Abasi mfo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“ ‘Asenawo amaadʌñ ke atu ndufo ke isọñ ndufo, ikiikuut ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Idat adidʌñ a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo nte amanaisọñ. Ima ammọ nte idem ndufo, sia ndufo emaedo mme adidʌñ ke Iyib. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“ ‘Ikiidat idiọọk udomoñkpọ idomo ñkpọ inọọ awo, me ke adidomo unyọọñ, me udob me uwak. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Ikama nnen-nnen udomoñkpọ ye nnen-nnen udob, nnen-nnen efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efa ado udomoñkpọ nsaad ñkpọ a-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 22.</char></note> ye nnen-nnen hin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hin ado udomoñkpọ mmọọñ-mmọọñ ñkpọ a-adooho ñkpọ nte akpọ keed me lita 3.8.</char></note>. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akibenne ndufo awuọ ke Iyib.<verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />“ ‘Inịm afịd mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed mmi, inyʌñ inam ammọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ufen Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate: ‘Awo akeedodo ke atu nditọ Isrel me ke atu isenawo e-edʌññọ ke Isrel, abenne ayịn amọ ndomokeed awa uwa anọ Mọlek, ana ewot anye. Yak mbon abio etọọñ anye ke itiad ewot. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Ami ke idem mmi ñyaawuuk iso mmi nse anye ñnyʌñ ñkpịkke anye nsio ke atu mbon amọ; sia ke adiben nditọ amọ ñwaa uwa nnọọ Mọlek, anye asappa itieukpono mmi anyʌñ abiat adisana anyịñ mmi. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Mbon abio ado ekpenam nte ikịtte naña awo ado awa keed ke atu nditọ amọ anọ Mọlek, ndin amọ iwotto anye, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />ami ke idem mmi ñyaawuuk iso mmi nse anye ye ubon amọ ñnyʌñ ñkpịkke ammọ nsio ke atu ubon ammọ, anye ye afịd mbon se ikeene anye inie ewuana akpara ye Mọlek.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“ ‘Ami ñyaawuuk anyen mmi nse awo akeedodo a-akaaha useñkpọ me a-akeeneke mbiaidiọñ anam akpara ye ammọ ke adikeene ammọ, ndin ami ñyaasobo ammọ nsio ke atu mbon ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />“ ‘Inam idem ndufo asana inyʌñ ido adisana, sia ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Inịm mme ewʌhọ mmi inyʌñ inam ammọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anamma ndufo edo ndisana.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“ ‘Awo akeedodo a-asuuñọke ete me eka amọ, ana ewot anye. Sia ammọ esuuñọ ete me eka, iyiib ammọ ayaakọbọ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“ ‘Awo akpesịn efịbe ye anwaan awo mfen, ye anwaan mbọhọidʌñ amọ, ammọ awo iba ado enie edikpa.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />“ ‘Awo akpenie ewuana ye anwaan ete amọ, anye amiom ete amọ. Awo ado ye awonwaan ado enie edikpa; iyiib ammọ adiikọbọ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />“ ‘Awo akpenie ewuana ye anwaan ayịn amọ, ammọ awo iba enie edikpa. Se ammọ enam ado mbubiam ido; iyiib ammọ adiikọbọ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />“ ‘Awo akpenie ewuana ye emọ-emọ awodeen nte anie ye awonwaan, ammọ awo iba enam mbubiam ido. Enie ediwot ammọ; iyiib ammọ adiikọbọ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />“ ‘Awo akpedọ awonwaan amaana adọ eka awonwaan ado, ado ibak. Ana efọp anye ye ibaan iba ado ke ikañ, mbaak ibak adiba ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />“ ‘Awodeen akpenie ewuana ye unam, enie adiwot anye, ana afo awot unam ado ñko.<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />“ ‘Awonwaan akpebịne unam adinie ewuana ye anye, yak ewot awonwaan ado ye unam ado. Ana ewot ammọ; iyiib ammọ adiikọbọ ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“ ‘Awodeen akpedọ ayịneka amọ awonwaan, ayịn awonwaan ake ete amọ abonno me anye ake eka amọ amanna, ndin ammọ enie ewuana, ado ñkpọ asuenne. Enie edisio ammọ mfep ke atu mbon abio ammọ anwa-anwa. Anye a-anọ ayịneka amọ awonwaan ndọk ndin anye ayaabiom utịb idiọọk ido amọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />“ ‘Awodeen akpenie ewuana ye awonwaan ke ini anye abaaha ke itieisọñ amọ, anye afʌkkọ itie i-iyiib atooho awuọ, awonwaan ado ñko anyʌñ afʌkkọ itie ado anịm. Enie ediwot ammọ nsio ke atu mbon ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“ ‘Kuunie ewuana ye ayịneka eka mfo me ye ayịneka ete mfo, sia ado ayaado ñkpọ asuenne anọ aduuk mfo; ammọ awo iba eyaebọ ufen idiọọk adinam ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />“ ‘Awodeen akpenie ewuana ye ayịneka ete me ayịneka eka amọ awonwaan, anye a-asuenne ayịneka ete me ayịneka eka amọ awodeen. Ammọ eyaebọ ufen idiọọk adinam ammọ; eyaekpa inieghe nditọ.<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />“ ‘Awodeen akpedọ anwaan ayịneka amọ, ado ndedeghe ñkpọ; anye asuenne ayịneka amọ. Ammọ ediido mme anana ayịn.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“ ‘Inịm afịd ewʌhọ ye mbed mmi inyʌñ inam ammọ, mbaak isọñ ake ami idatta ndufo ndʌk mbo edʌñ adikọk ndufo asio. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Inaaha ndufo edu uwem ekeene ido mme idịd a-ami mbooho mbịne nsio ke iso ndufo. Ami mmaasịn ammọ ke ntak a-ammọ ekenamma afịd mme ñkpọ emi, ami mmaasua ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Ado ñkidọkkọ ndufo nte, “Eyaedat isọñ ammọ enie; ñyainọ enie nte udeemeñkpọ ndufo, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk.” Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, i-idiaññake ndufo asio akpọñ mme idịd mfen.<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />“ ‘Ana ndufo ndin ediọọñọ ukpʌhọde a-abaaha ke ufọọd unam se isana ye anye i-imiisanake, ye inuen i-imiisanake ye anye a-asanake. Ikiisappa idem ndufo ye unam me inuen me ñkpọ ndomokeed akeedodo a-anyọọnọ ke isọñ, mbon se ami ndiañña nnịm mbo ke edo ndedeghe inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Ndufo enie edido ndisana innọ miin sia ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndo adisana, ndin ami mmesio ndufo nnịm asaña-asaña ke atu mme idịd nọ edo ake mmi.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“ ‘Awodeen me awonwaan a-adooho akịdñkukịd me abiaekpo ke atu ndufo ana akpa. Enie editọọñ ammọ ke itiad; iyiib ammọ adiikọbọ ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ewʌhọ A-anieghe Mme Aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Tañ nọ mme aku, nditọ ideen Erọn, nyʌñ bo ammọ ate: ‘Aku inaaha asappa idem amọ ke abaña awo ammọ ndomokeed a-akpaaha, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />ibọhọke ado ataa awo idem amọ, nte eka me ete amọ, ayịn amọ awodeen me awonwaan, ayịneka amọ awodeen, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />me ayịneka amọ awonwaan i-imiidọọhọ ebe a-anieghe idodanyen ke anye sia anye imiinieghe ebe, anye akeme adisappa idem amọ nnọọ anye. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Inaaha anye asappa idem amọ anọ mbon ewanake ñkpọ ye anye ke ndọ, nọ ato do anye anam idem amọ adeghe.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“ ‘Mme aku inaaha efat ided iwuod ammọ me ekwat mben ñwaebek ammọ me ekpii idem ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Ana edo ndisana enọ Abasi ammọ, ke enyʌñ esịn anyịñ Abasi ammọ ke ndek. Sia ammọ edo mme awa uwa ndidia nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndidia Abasi ammọ, ana ammọ edo ndisana.<verse eid="LEV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />“ ‘Inaaha ammọ edọ ibaan akpara me ibaan se iwuọñọ ndọ ikpọñ mme ebe ammọ, sia mme aku edo ndisana enọ Abasi ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Idat ammọ nte ndisana, sia ammọ ewa ndidia Abasi ndufo. Inịm ammọ nte ndisana, sia ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndo adisana, ami nnam ndufo edo ndisana.<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />“ ‘Ayịn awonwaan aku akpesappa idem amọ ke adido akpara, anye asuenne ete amọ; ana efọp anye ke ikañ.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“ ‘Ekamba aku, awo ke atu ammọ e-eyette adan unịm idiọọñọ ke iwuod, e-enyʌññọ edot anye ubọk adisịne mme nsiine aku, inaaha ayak ided amọ asuakka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido inaaha anịm iwuod amọ inwañ</char></note> inyʌññọ ina awai afọñ amọ. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Inaaha anye adʌk itie ake akpo awo anaaha. Inaaha asappa idem amọ akpekọm ke ntak ete me eka amọ, <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />inaaha akpọñ adisana itieukpono Abasi amọ, inaaha anyʌñ asịn itieukpono ado ke ndek, sia edat adisana adan Abasi amọ ekpọnnọ anye enịm asaña-asaña. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />“ ‘Ana anye adọ awonwaan i-imiidiọọñọke awodeen akpa. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Inaaha anye adọ ebekpa, me awonwaan e-emaekesio ke ndọ, me akpara, ado anie adidọ abọikpa i-imiidiọọñọke awodeen kpaanam, a-atooho aduuk amọ, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />mbaak anye adisappa ubon amọ ke atu aduuk amọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anamma anye ado adisana.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Dọkkọ Erọn bo: ‘Awo akeedodo ke ubon mfo ke mme emana ye emana ke ini iso, a-abiomoke ndo, inaaha asaña akpere adiwa uwa ndidia Abasi amọ. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Awo ndomokeed a-abiomoke ndo inaaha asaña akpere; awo ndomokeed a-adooho nnan, me mbʌñọ, me awoñkpọnnam me inyọọn; <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />awo ndomokeed a-adooho mbʌññọ ke ukod me ubọk, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />me a-anieghe ekʌñ me a-adooho isọ, me a-anieghe mfịna ke anyen, me a-atakka ndọk me a-anieghe nnanuaha ñkwamfed. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Awo ndomokeed ke ubon aku Erọn a-abiomoke ndo inaaha asaña akpere adidiwa uwa ndidia nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye anie ndo; inaaha anye asaña akpere adidiwa uwa ndidia Abasi amọ. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Anye akeme adidia ataa adisana ndidia Abasi amọ, ukem ye adisana ndidia; <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />ado ke ntak ndo amọ, inaaha anye asaña akpere ikpeghe me akpokoro uwa, nọ ato do adinam adisana itieukpono mmi adeghe. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anamma ammọ esana.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Ndin Moses amaadọkkọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ye afịd nditọ Isrel ñkpọ ami.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Dọkkọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ bo yak ammọ ekpono ndisana enọ a-nditọ Isrel ekpọnnọke enịm asaña-asaña ennọọ, mbaak ammọ edibiat adisana anyịñ mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />“Bo ammọ ate: ‘Ke mme emana se idiidi ke ayio iso, awo akeedodo ke ubon ndufo i-imiisanake ado asaña akpere ndisana enọ a-nditọ Isrel ekpọnnọke enịm asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana ebịne awo ado efep ke iso mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />“ ‘Adieke awo ke ubon Erọn anieghe udọñọ akpamfia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ikọ adaaha anọ idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem ado akpamfia a-anyʌññọ ada anọ nsio-nsio udọñọ ke ikpaidem.</char></note> me ñkpọ akpewuọñọ anye ke idem, anye inaaha adia adisana uwa tutu emaenam anye asana. Anye ñko adiido ndedeghe adieke anye atuuhọ ñkpọ se akpo awo amaakesappa me awo a-nsene awuọñọke ke idem, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />me adieke anye atuuhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed se inyọnyọọn nọ anam anye ado ndedeghe, me awo ndomokeed a-anamma anye ado ndedeghe, se utọ ndedeghe akpedodo. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Awo atuuhọ utọ ñkpọ ado adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. Inaaha anye adia ndomokeed ke atu ndisana enọ ado ibọhọke anye ayie idem ke mmọọñ. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Ayio amaatekke, anye ayaasana, do ndin anye akeme adidia ndisana enọ, sia ndidia amọ ke ado. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Inaaha anye ata adukpo ñkpọ me se unam ikọd awot, nọ ato ke ado anye ado ndedeghe. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“ ‘Mme aku enie edinam utom mmi ke usʌñ a-ammọ imiidiinamma ndudue ñnyʌñ ñkpa ke adinam emiom ke utom mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anamma ammọ edo ndisana.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“ ‘Awo ndomokeed i-imiitooho ufọk aku inaaha adia adisana uwa, asenawo aku me awo utom amọ inaaha adia ñko. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Ado aku akpedat akʌk adep afʌn, me mme ifʌn emana ke ufọk amọ, ammọ ekeme edidia ndidia amọ. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Ayịn awonwaan aku akpedọ awo mfen i-imiidooho aku, yak ke anye adia mme ndisana enọ ado. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Ado ayịn awonwaan aku akpekappa ebekpa me awuọñọ ndọ, ado inieghe nditọ, ndin anyọñ adidʌñ ke ufọk ete amọ nte idaha anye akedooho abọikpa, anye akeme adidia ndidia ete amọ. Inaaha awo ndomokeed mfen i-imiidotto adia anye.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“ ‘Awo akeedodo a-adiaha adisana ñkpọ ke ndudue ana anọ aku usiene enọ ado anyʌñ adian mbakka keed ke itie ition ñkpọ ado. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Inaaha mme aku esappa ndisana ñkpọ a-nditọ Isrel enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />ke adiyak ammọ edia ndisana uwa ñnyʌñ mben ndudue ndot ammọ a-ayemme se ekpe isob ndot ammọ ke idem. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anamma ammọ esana.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Uwa A-awo Imiibọọhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Tañ dọkkọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ye afịd nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Adieke awo ndufo ndomokeed, me awo Isrel me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke Isrel, adatta enọ ufọfọb uwa asọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, me ado adisio akaaña me ado enọ imaesịd, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />ana enọ ayaara i-imiinieghe ndo, ke atu enañ, edọñ me ebod nọ ato do ebọ ke iwuod ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Ikiiben ñkpọ se inie ndo idi, sia awo idiibọọhọ ke iwuod ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Awo amaadat ato udịmenañ me udịmedọñ adi adiwa nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa ewuana, adisio asaña-asaña akaaña me adinọ enọ imaesịd, ana ado anana ndo mbemiso ebọ. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Kuuwaa se ido nnan, se inie unan me ido mbʌñọ, me ñkpọ ndomokeed akeedodo atakka mfad me inia. Ikiiwaa mme ñkpọ ami ke akpokoro uwa inọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa ndidia. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Amekeme adinọ abaakenañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ayaara me uman</char></note> me edọñ a-anieghe ndo me a-adooho itiitịb nte ñkpọ enọ imaesịd, ado awo idiibọọhọ nte akaaña. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Inaaha ndufo enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unam se ebom, enuak, ewai me ekpịkke ñkwamfed amọ. Inaaha enam ami ke isọñ ndufo, <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />inaaha ndufo enyʌñ ebọ mme utọ unam ado ke ubọk asenawo eben enọ nte ndidia Abasi ndufo. Awo idiibọọhọ ammọ ke iwuod ndufo, sia ammọ enie ndo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Ñyịn enañ me ñyịn edọñ me ebod amaamana, anye adiiba ye eka amọ usen itiaba. Tọọñọ ke ayọhọ usen itiaita, eyaebọ anye nte uwa ndidia enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Ikiiwot umanenañ me edọñ ye ñyịn amọ usen keed.<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />“Ndufo emaewa uwa ekọọm enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ewa anye ke usʌñ adiido se ebọ ke iwuod ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Ana edia anye kpa usen ado; ikiisʌhọ ndomokeed nọ ayio asiere. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Ndufo inịm mme ewʌhọ mmi inyʌñ inam ammọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Ikiibiat adisana anyịñ mmi, sia ana nditọ Isrel endat nte adisana. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akenamma ndufo esana <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />a-akenyʌññọ isio ndufo ke isọñ Iyib nọ ndido Abasi ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Usọrọ A-anaaha Enam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Mme usọrọ a-ami mmekke mbo edia ado ami, mme usọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-ndufo ediikwọrọ nte ndisana mbono.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />“ ‘Usen itiokeed aba se ndufo edat enam utom, ado ayọhọ usen itiaba ado usen nduọkadudu sabad, usen adisana mbono. Inaaha enam utom ndomokeed; ke itie nte edọdʌñ, anye ado sabad anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ye Usọrọ Uyo a-Yiis Imiisịneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />“ ‘Mbon ami edo mme usọrọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amek, ndisana mbono a-anaaha enam ke akem ini. <verse eid="LEV 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atọọñọ ndubiayio ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke akpa afiọñ. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke afiọñ ado Usọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ake Uyo a-Yiis Imiisịnneke atọọñọ; ana eta uyo se yiis imiisịneke ke afịd usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Ke akpa usen inịm adisana esob, ikiinyʌñ inam kpak utom ndomokeed. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Ke afịd usen itiaba ado, inam uwa ndidia inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba inịm adisana mbono, ikiinyʌñ inam utom ndomokeed.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Enọ Akpa Mfịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Ke ini ndufo edʌkkọ isọñ a-ami mbooho inọ ndufo do e-enyʌñ edọk mbunwịm amọ, iben abek akpa mfịd e-edọkkọ isọk aku. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Anye ana aben abek mfịd ado afʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nọ ato do ebọ anye ke iwuod ndufo; aku anie adifʌñ anye ke edem usen Sabad. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Ke usen andufo efʌññọ abek mfịd ado, ana ndufo edat ñyịn edọñ isua keed i-imiinieghe ndo ewa ufọfọb uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />dian ye uwa ñkpasi amọ a-adooho mbakka efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.2; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 22:17</char></note> iba ke itie duob ataa eti ndomuyo ewuaha ye adan ọlif, uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anemufịk ndidia, ye unwọnwọñ ukọd uwa amọ a-adooho ukọd ke mbakka hin keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita keed</char></note> ke itie inaañ. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Inaaha ndufo eta uyo, me utetịbe abakpa me ufa ñkpasi tutu usen a-ndufo ebenne uwa ami edisọk Abasi ndufo. Ami anie adido nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana ke ini iso, ke itie akeedodo a-ndufo edʌññọ.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usọrọ Mme Udua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“ ‘Tọọñọ ke edem usen Sabad, usen a-ndufo ekebenne abek ufọfʌñ uwa edi, ibat ayọhọ-ayọhọ udua itiaba isio. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Ibat usen aba mme duob tutu akem edem usen ayọhọ Sabad itiaba, ndin iwa uwa ufa ñkpasi inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Ito itie akeedodo a-ndufo edʌññọ idi, idat efiak uyo iba e-edatta mbakka iba ke itie duob efa ataa eti ndomuyo enam, isịn yiis, nte ufọfʌñ uwa akpa mfịd inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Idian ñyaara ñyịn edọñ itiaba ye uyo ami inọ, ammọ keedekeed ana edo isua keed inyʌññọ inie ndo, ayaara enañ keed ye akukịmedọñ iba. Ammọ ediido ufọfọb uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, adiana ye uwa ñkpasi ye adinwọñ uwa ammọ, uwa ndidia, anemme ufịk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Ndin iwa akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana</char></note> ye edọñ iba e-edooho isua keed nte uwa ewuana. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Aku anie adifʌñ nditọ edọñ iba ado ye uyo mme akpa mfịd ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. Ammọ edo adisana uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ake aku. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Kpa ke usen ado ke ndufo ediikoot adisana esob, ndufo idiinyʌññọ inam utom ndomokeed. Ami ana ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana ke ayio iso, ke itie akeedodo a-ndufo edʌññọ.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“ ‘Ke ini a-ndufo edọkkọ ñkpọ inwañ ndufo, ikiidọk ñkpọ se iba ke adaña inwañ, ikiinyʌñ ikoono se ibọkkọ iduọññọ ke isọñ ke ini edọkkọ. Iyaak mbon ado inọ mme uweene ye mme adidʌñ se idʌñ ke atu ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usọrọ Adukpoñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, ana ndufo enie usen nduọkadudu sabad, adisana mbono edatta ufịt adukpoñ etoiyo. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Ikiinam utom usen ado, ado iwa uwa ndidia inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usen Unam Ñkpeubọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba ami ado Usen Unam Ñkpeubọk. Inịm adisana mbono inyʌñ isuuhọ idem ndufo ke aditre ndidia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido aditie utreudia; kpa ntoro ke Lefitikọs 23:29 ye 32</char></note> inyʌñ iwa uwa ndidia inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Ikiinam utom ndomokeed ke usen ado, sia ado Usen Unam Ñkpeubọk, e-enamma ñkpeubọk inọọ ndufo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Mbon i-imiisuuhọke idem ke utre udia ke usen ado, ana ebịne ammọ esio ke atu mbon ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Ami ñyaasobo awo akeedodo a-adiinam utom ndomokeed ke usen ado ke atu mbon abio ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Inaaha enam utom ndomokeed. Ami ana ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana ke ini iso, ke itie akeedodo a-ndufo edʌññọ. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Ado usen nduọkadudu sabad inọ ndufo, ke ntoro ana esuuhọ idem ndufo ke utre ndidia. Tọọñọ ke ndubiayio ayọhọ usen usʌkkeed ke afiọñ ado tutu ndubiayio edem usen, enie adinịm sabad ndufo.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atọọñọ, ndin anye adiidat usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Akpa usen ado adisana mbono; ikiinam utom ndomokeed. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Ke afịd usen itiaba inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>uwa ndidia, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaita inịm adisana mbono inyʌñ iwa uwa ndidia inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye ado akpatre usen asaña-asaña mbono; ikiinam utom ndomokeed.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />(“ ‘Mme usọrọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> anịmme ado ami, a-ndufo enieghe edikoot ndisana mbono nọ edat uwa ndidia esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mme ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa ñkpasi, mme uwa ye mme adinwọñ uwa, naña eyem ke usen ke usen. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Mme uwa ami edo ediben ndian ye ake Sabad <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme enọ ndufo ye se adodo a-ndufo ekenwọñọke adinọ, ye afịd enọ imaesịd a-ndufo enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.)<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“ ‘Anam tọọñọ ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, ke emaekekoono mbunwịm inwañ ebok, inam usọrọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> usen itiaba; akpa usen ado usen nduọkadudu sabad, ayọhọ usen itiaita anyʌñ ado usen nduọkadudu sabad ñko. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Ke akpa usen ndufo eyaedat ñkọk mfọọn ikpọ eto, eto ayob, eto mben mmọọñ, ye mme utọ eto mfen se inie mfañ enyʌñ enam idaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke afịd usen itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Inịm ami nte usọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd usen itiaba kwa isua. Ami anie adido nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana ke ini iso; inam usọrọ ado ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Ke usen itiaba, idʌñ ke mme itie nnaa e-ebọppọ yak ada ke etək-etək ini. Afịd mme amanaisọñ nditọ Isrel enie edidʌñ ke mme utọ itie nnaa ado <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />nọ nditọ ndufo ediọọñọ ke ami mmaanam nditọ Isrel edʌñ ke mme itie nnaa e-ebọppọ yak ada ke etək-etək ini ke idaha a-ami ñkesioho ammọ ke Iyib. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Ndin Moses amaaben mme ini usọrọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenịmme atañ anọ nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s1">Adan Ọlif ye Uyo E-Enịmme ke Iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate edat adan a-asanake, enyịmmeke eto ọlif usọk fiin se edat edomo ikañ nọ mme utuenikañ esak afịd ini. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Ke anwa ikpeghe itie a-afʌkkọ akebe mbed edioomo ke atayad mbono, Erọn anie adikpeme mme utuenikañ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> tọọñọ ke ndubiayio tutu ubakusen, afịd ini. Ami anie adido nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ mme emana se idiidi. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Ana enekke ekpeme mme utuenikañ e-edoroke ke ñkpọ udodikañ ataa kold ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd ini.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Dat ataa eti ndomuyo tem eboho uyo duob mme iba, kama mbakka iba ke itie duob efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.2</char></note> nam eboho uyo keed. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Neeñe ammọ bon ke udịm iba, itiokeed ke udịm keedekeed, ke akpokoro ataa kold a-anaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Ke mben udịm keedekeed nịm ataa nsasana insensi nte ñkpọ aditoiyo nọ ada anọ uyo, anyʌñ ado uwa ndidia e-ewaaha enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Ana esio eboho uyo ami enịm ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ini ke ini, ke Sabad ke Sabad, ke iwuod nditọ Isrel, nte nsi-nsi edioomo. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Anye ami ado ewʌhọ a-anieghe Erọn ye nditọ amọ, ado ana ammọ edia ñkpọ ke adisana itie, sia ado ataa nsasana ubaak nsi-nsi udeeme uwa ndidia a-ammọ enamma enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Awo A-asappake Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Akem ayịn awodeen ayịn awonwaan Isrel keed e-ete amọ akedooho awo Iyib, amaawuọ ke atu nditọ Isrel, ndin anwan amaasakka ke nnaaekọñ ke ufọọd amọ ye awo Isrel. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Ayịn awodeen ayịn awonwaan Isrel ado amaasappa Anyịñ ado ye isuuñọ; ndin emaeben anye ebịne Moses. (Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Selomid, ayịn Dibri, awo esiin Daan.) <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Ammọ emaekọp anye enịm ke ufọk tutu ediọọñọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduak adinam.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Ben asappa nsappa ado wuọ ke nnaaekọñ. Yak afịd mbon se ikikop anye edot anye ubọk ke iwuod, ndin yak afịd atu awo etọọñ anye ke itiad. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate: ‘Awo akeedodo a-asuuñọke Abasi ammọ ayaabiom idiọọk ido amọ; <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />awo akeedodo a-asappake anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, enie ediwot anye. Afịd atu awo ana etọọñ anye ke itiad. Me ado asenawo me ado amanaisọñ, emaesịn Anyịñ ado ke ndek, ana ewot ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“ ‘Awo ndomokeed a-awotto awo, enie ediwot anye. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Awo ndomokeed a-awotto ufene awo mfen ana anọ usiene, sia uwem aka ke uwem. <verse eid="LEV 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />Awo a-anọọhọ mbọhọidʌñ amọ unan, enie edinọ anye ukem unan ado: <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />abʌññọakpọ aka ke abʌññọakpọ, anyen aka ke anyen, eded aka ke eded. Awo a-anọọhọ awo unan ana abọ kpa ukem unan ado. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Awo akeedodo a-awotto ufene awo ana anọ usiene, ado awo akeedodo a-awotto awo ana ewot anye. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Ndufo enie edinịm ukem-ukem mbed nnọọ asenawo ye amanaisọñ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Ndin Moses amaadọkkọ nditọ Isrel, ndin ammọ emaeben asappa nsappa ado ewuọ ke nnaaekọñ eketọọñ anye ke itiad. Nditọ Isrel emaenam naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Isua Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ke Abod Sainai ate, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate: ‘Imaidʌk isọñ a-ami mbooho inọ ndufo do, isọñ ado ke idem amọ ana anie ini sabad anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Ke isua itiokeed itọ mme inwañ ndufo, ñko ke isua itiokeed idiọñ inwañ fain ndufo inyʌñ idọk mme mfịd ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Ado ke ayọhọ isua itiaba yak isọñ anie nduọkadudu sabad isua keed, sabad enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ikiitọ utọ, ikiinyʌñ idiọñ inwañ fain ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Ikiidọk se itịppe ke idem amọ, ikiinyʌñ itañ mme kreb a-ndufo imiikikpemeke, e-ekenwịmme ke idem ammọ. Ana isọñ anie nduọkadudu isua keed. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Se mbunwịm isọñ ado anwịm ke isua sabad ado adiido ndidia inọ ndufo, afo ke idem mfo, nditọufọk ideen ye ibaan mfo, ye ukpekpe awo utom ye awo anyʌññọ adʌñ ke atu ndufo ke etək-etək ini, <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />ye udịmedọñ ndufo ye mme unam ikọd e-ebaaha ke isọñ ndufo. Ekeme edidia se adodo anwịmme ato isọñ.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isua Yubili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />“ ‘Ibat isua sabad itiaba isio, isua itiaba ke itie itiaba, nọ isua sabad itiaba ayọhọ isua aba mme usʌkkeed. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Ndin yak efịt adukpoñ ke afịd itie ke ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba; ke Usen Unam Ñkpeubọk ifịt adukpoñ ke afịd isọñ abio ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Inam ayọhọ isua aba mme duob asana inyʌñ inam ntadñyaak ke afịd isọñ inọ afịd mme andidʌñ ke esịd. Adiido yubili inọ ndufo; ndufo keedekeed enie editịmme ñnyọñ ñkeene inie ubon ndufo ñnyʌñ mbịne imaan ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Ayọhọ isua aba mme duob adiido isua yubili inọ ndufo; ikiitọ ikiinyʌñ idọk se itịppe ke idem amọ, ikiinyʌñ idọk mme fain a-ndufo imiikitọọhọ, e-etịppeke ke idem ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Sia ado yubili ndin ana ado adisana inọ ndufo; idia se edat eto inwañ kpọd.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />“ ‘Ke Isua Yubili afịd awo enie editịmme ñnyọñ ñkeene inie ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />“ ‘Ikpinyam isọñ inọ mbon ndufo me edep isọñ eto ammọ, ikiitʌk idem ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Idep ito mbon ndufo ikeene ibad isua yubili. Ndin ammọ enie edinyam inọọ ndufo ñkeene ibad isua se isʌhọ adidọk idọk. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Isua amaawak, afo anie adinam udua adọọk, isua imiiwakka, afo anie adisuuhọ udua, sia se enekke enyam unọọ fiin ado ibad mfịd inwañ. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Ikiitʌk idem ndufo, ado ibaak Abasi ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“ ‘Ikeene mme ewʌhọ mmi inyʌñ ikpeme adinịm mme mbed mmi, ndin eyaedʌñ ke isọñ ke ifuuro. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Ndin isọñ ayaanwịm mbunwịm amọ, ndufo eyaenyʌñ edia eyʌkkọ enyʌñ edʌñ do ke ifuuro. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Ndufo emekeme edibịp ebo, “Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiidia ke ayọhọ isua itiaba adieke ñnyịn imiitọọhọ inyʌññọ idọk mme ñkpọ inwañ ñnyịn?” <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Ñyaanọ adidiọñ isọk ke ayọhọ isua itiokeed, adidiọñ a-adiinam isọñ anwịm se idiikem se edia ke isua ita. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Ke ini ediitọ ñkpọ ke ayọhọ isua itiaita, ediidia ito akaan utọ, enyʌñ ekaa iso edia eto do tutu idọk ayọhọ isua usʌkkeed.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />“ ‘Ikiinyam isọñ afịd-afịd, sia isọñ ado ami nnie ndin ndufo edʌñ ke isọñ mmi nte mme adidʌñ ye mme isenawo. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Ke afịd isọñ se afo ekama nte inie, ana ndufo enam usʌñ naña ediifaka isọñ ado.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />“ ‘Keed ke atu nditọ Isrel ndufo akpekappa uweene anyʌñ anyaam ubaak inie amọ, awo a-atooho ufọk amọ ana adifakka se ammọ ekenyam. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Akpedo anam ibaaha awo se idifakka inọ ammọ ado akema ammọ edinie ñkpọ enyʌñ enie ukeme edifakka anye ke idem ammọ, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />yak ammọ ebat udua isọñ ekeene mme isua a-ammọ ekenyamma anye enyʌñ ekpọñ se isʌhọ enọ awo a-ammọ ekenyamma enọ; ammọ ndin ekeme editịmme ñkedat inie ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Ado ammọ imiinieghe ukeme adikpe, se ekenyam ayaasọọñọ aba nte inie andikidep tutu Isua Yubili. Ediikappa inọ mme andinie ke ini Yubili, ndin ammọ ekeme aditịmme ñkedat inie ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />“ ‘Awo a-anyamma ufọk ke abio e-ebọppọ ndibene ekanna asʌk anenie ayọhọ unen adifakka anye ke ufañ isua keed tọọñọ anye akenyam. Ke ufọọd isua keed ado andikinyam akeme adimaana mbọọ ndep. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Akpedo anam andikinyam ifakkake ke ufọọd isua keed ado, ufọk ado ke abio ebọppọ ndibene ekanna do adiinie andideb ye afịd emana amọ. Inaaha ekappa enọ anye ke Yubili. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Ado mme ufọk ke mme abio a-awo imiibọppọ ndibene ikanna edat ammọ nte esịne ke inwañ abio. Ekeme edifak ammọ ntịmme ñyaak nnọ andikinie ke Isua Yubili.<verse eid="LEV 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />“ ‘Mme Lifai enie unen afịd ini adifakka mme ufọk ammọ ke mme abio mme Lifai, a-ammọ enieghe. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Ke ntoro inie mme Lifai ado se efakka, ado ado ntom, ufọk akeedodo enyamma ke abio a-ammọ ekamake a-anaaha efakka ke Yubili, sia mme ufọk ke mme abio mme Lifai edo inie ammọ ke atu nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Ado inaaha enyam mme ikọd ubọọk ufene a-anieghe mme abio ammọ; anye ado ado nsi-nsi udeeme ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />“ ‘Ayịn Isrel ndufo ndomokeed akpekappa uweene ndin inyʌññọ ikan ikama idem ammọ aba ke atu ndufo, inyaaña ammọ ukem naña ekpenyaaña asenawo me adidʌñ, nọ ato do ammọ ekan ekaiso edʌñ ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Ikiibọọ ammọ udod, ado ibaak Abasi ndufo, nọ ammọ ekaiso edʌñ ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Inaaha ndufo enọ ammọ ewuọd akʌk eyem udod me enyam ndidia enọ ammọ eyem udod. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akisioho ndufo ke Iyib adinọ isọñ Kenan ñnyʌñ ndido Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“ ‘Awo Isrel ndufo ndomokeed akpekappa uweene enyʌñ enyam idem ammọ inọ ndufo, ikiinam ammọ enam utom nte mme ifʌn. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Idat ammọ nte mbon e-ekpeeghekpe utom me nte mbon e-edʌññọ ye ndufo ke etək-etək ini; ammọ enie edinam utom inọọ ndufo tutu akem Isua Yubili. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Amaama ado esaana ammọ ye nditọ ammọ eyaak, ndin ammọ eyaetịmme ebịne ubon ammọ ye mme inie mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Sia adooho nditọ Isrel edo ikọd mmi, a-ami ñkesioho ke Iyib, inaaha enyam ammọ nte mme ifʌn. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Ikiikara ammọ ke ufịk, ado ibaak Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />“ ‘Ifʌn ideen ye ifʌn ibaan ndufo ediito mme idịd mfen ke ñkanñkʌk ndufo; emekeme idep ifʌn nto ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Emekeme adinyʌñ ndep mbon edʌññọdʌñ ke ufọọd ndufo ye mbon ubon ammọ e-emanake ke abio ndufo, ndin ammọ eyaekappa edo inie ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Emekeme ikpọñ ammọ nnọọ nditọ ndufo nte inie adiaakpa, ammọ enyʌñ edo ifʌn ke nsi-nsi, ado inaaha ekara nditọ Isrel ndufo ke ufịk.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“ ‘Adieke asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo akpekappa amọinyọ nọ awo Isrel ndufo ndomokeed akappa uweene enyʌñ enyam idem ammọ enọ asenawo me ubon asenawo ado <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />enie unen adifakka ammọ ke ammọ emaekenyam idem ammọ. Awo keed ke ubon ammọ akeme adifakka ammọ: <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Ayịneka ete, ayịneka eka me ayịn ayịneka ete me ayịn ayịneka eka me awo ubon ammọ ke atu imaan ammọ akeme adifak ammọ. Ammọ ke idem ammọ ekpedinie ñkpọ, ekeme adifakka idem ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Ammọ ye mme andideb ammọ enie edibat ini tọọñọ ke isua ammọ ekenyamma idem ammọ tutu akesịm Isua Yubili. Ekọmudua adidat ifakka ammọ adiikeene se ekpe anamutom ke utọ ibad isua ado. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Isua se isʌhọ akpewak, ana ammọ ekpe udua se ikpon ikan se ekekpe efak ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Akpedo isua se isʌhọ iwakka mbemiso ewuọ Isua Yubili, ammọ enie edibat naña adʌk ñnyʌñ ñkpe mfakka idem ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Ana ekama ammọ nte mbon e-ekekpeeghe utom ke isua ke isua; ana ekịt ebo ke mbon a-ammọ enamma utom enọ ikarake ammọ ke ufiik.<verse eid="LEV 25:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />“ ‘Akpekọm awo ifakka ammọ ke mme utọ usʌñ ami, ana esaana ammọ ye nditọ ammọ eyak ke Isua Yubili, <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />sia nditọ Isrel edo ake mmi nte nditọufọk mmi. Ammọ edo nditọufọk mmi, a-ami ñkesioho ke Iyib. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpọ Ayịnutom Ñkobitem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />“ ‘Ndufo ikiinam mme ubobod abasi me usọsọi ñkpọ me adisana itiad inọ idem ndufo, ikiinyʌñ inịm ukakab itiad ke isọñ ndufo ituak iwuod inọọ anye. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />“ ‘Inịm mme Sabad mmi inyʌñ inie ukpono inọ itieukpono mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“ ‘Adieke ndufo ekeeneke mme mbed mmi enyʌñ ekpeme edinịm mme ewʌhọ mmi, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />ami ñyaanọ edịm isọk ke akem ini, ndin isọñ ayaanwịm mbunwịm, mme eto enyʌñ enwịm mfịd ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Ini utịm abakpa ndufo adiisʌk ikaka iso tutu akem ini ukịppe kreb, ndin ini ukịppe kreb ayaakaa iso tutu ini utọ ñkpọ, ndin ndufo eyaedia afịd ndidia se ndufo eyem enyʌñ edʌñ ke ifuuro ke isọñ ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“ ‘Ami ñyaanọ emem ke isọñ, ndin ndufo eyaesuuk enaa, ndin awo ndomokeed idinamma ndufo ekop ndịk. Ami ñyaasịññe mme afai unam ikọd mfep ke isọñ, ndin akañkañ idiiboiyoke ke isọñ idʌñ ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Eyaebịne mme asua ndufo, ndin ammọ eyaeduọññọ ke akañkañ ke iso ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Awo ndufo ition eyaebịne awo ikie, ndin awo ndufo ikie eyaebịne awo tọsịn duob, ndin mme asua ndufo eyaeduọññọ ke akañkañ ke iso ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />“ ‘Ami ñyaafọn ido ye ndufo ñnyʌñ idiọñ ndufo ñnyʌñ nnam ndufo enwịm uwak mfịd enyʌñ etọt ke ibad, ami ñyaanyʌñ nnam edioomo mmi ye ndufo asọọñọ ada. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Ndufo ediisʌk idiadia ñkpọ idọk isua ako ke ini ndufo ediiyeyem naña esịññe ammọ nọ itie aba anọ ufa. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Ami ñyaanịm itie idʌñ mmi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido tabanakịd mmi</char></note> ke atu ndufo, ndiinyʌññọ isua ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Ami ñyaasaña ke atu ndufo ñnyʌñ ndo Abasi ndufo, ndufo enyʌñ edo ikọd mmi. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akisioho ndufo ke Iyib mbaak ndufo idido ifʌn aba inọọ nditọ Iyib; ami ñkebuuñ mme ukwak akpọnọ ndufo ñnyʌñ nnam ndufo ekan esaña edịppe iwuod ke anyọñ.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufen Nsọñiwuod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />“ ‘Ado ndufo imiikpañña utọñ innọ miin inyʌñ inam afịd mme item ami, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />ndufo ekpesịn mme ewʌhọ mmi enyʌñ esua mme mbed mmi, inamma mme item mmi ndin ato ke ado ndufo ebiat edioomo mmi, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />ndin se ndiinam ndufo ado ami: Ami ñyaanam ndufo ekịt ñkpọ ndịk ke unana idodanyen, mben ndiọi udọñọ ye ufiobidem idot ndufo, ndin ammọ eyaetịp ndufo anyen enyʌñ ibọ ndufo inweek. Ndufo eyaetọ ñkpọ ke ikpu-ikpu, sia mme asua ndufo ediidia. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Ami ñyaawọññọ iso ikpọñ ndufo nọ ato do mme asua ndufo ikan ndufo; mbon se isua ndufo eyaikara ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaefeeñe ke ini awo ndomokeed imiibịneke ndufo.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“ ‘Akpedo afịd ami atịppe ndufo isʌkkọ ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, ami ñyainọ ndufo ufen ke idiọọkñkpọ ndufo aboiyo utịme ñkentiaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Ami ñyaabuuñ nsọñiwuod ye iseri ndufo ñnyʌñ nnam ikpaanyọñ ndufo aba nte ukwak, isọñ ke idak ukod ndufo aba nte brọns. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Afịd adudu ndufo adiido ke ikpu-ikpu, sia isọñ ndufo idiinwịmme mme mbunwịm amọ, mme eto ke isọñ ndufo ñko idiinwịmme mfịd.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“ ‘Ndufo ekpesʌk ekaiso eba ke ndusuara ye ami enyʌñ esịn adikpañ utọñ innọọ miin, ami ñyaanam ndutʌhọ ndufo awak akañ itiaba akan se ado idahami, naña idiọọkñkpọ ndufo adot. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Ami ñyaadọñ ndiọi unam ikọd inọ ndufo, ndin ammọ eyaibọi nditọ ndufo, esobo mme udịmenañ ndufo enyʌñ enam ndufo iwakka aba ke ibad tutu mme akpọusʌñ ndufo enaa ukpọk.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“ ‘Akpedo anam kpa ye afịd ñkpọ ami ndufo inyịmmeke item mmi, ado ekaa iso ke ndusuara ye ami, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />ami ke idem mmi ñyaaba ke ndusuara ye ndufo ñnyʌñ itʌkkọ ndufo ke mme idiọọkñkpọ ndufo awak akan akañ itiaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Ñyaanyʌñ nnam akañkañ adʌk atu ndufo nọ asio usiene ubiad edioomo mmi. Emaetịmme enyọñ mme abio ndufo, ñyaadọñ idiọọk udọñọ nsobo ke atu ndufo, ndin eyaeyaak ndufo esịn ke ubọk mme asua. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Ami mmaatre adinọ ndufo uyo, ibaan duob eyaesañ uyo ke usañ uyo keed, enyʌñ edodomo uyo inọ ndufo. Eyaeta ado idiikoppo uyʌkkọ.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“ ‘Akpedo anam kpa ye afịd ñkpọ ami ndufo isʌkkọ ikpakpañ utọñ innọ ado ekaa iso ke ndusuara ye ami, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />ke iyadesịd mmi ami ñyaaba ke ndusuara ye ndufo, ndin ami ke idem mmi ñyaimia ndufo ufen ke mme idiọọkñkpọ ndufo utịme ñkentiaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Ndufo eyaeta abʌkidem nditọ ideen ndufo ye ake nditọ ibaan ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Ami ñyaasobo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ndufo, ñkpok mme akpokoro uwa insensi ndufo nduọñọ ñnyʌñ ntañ akpo ndufo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ ikpo ndufo</char></note> ndoot ke idem mme ananauwem ubobod ñkpọ ndufo, ndin ami ñyaisua ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Ñyaawuut mme abio ndufo ñnyʌñ nnam mme ndisana itie ndufo ekappa ndoon, ndin ndiikoppo inemesịd ke mme inemufịk uwa ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Ami ke idem mmi ñyaanam isọñ ndufo akappa ndoon, nọ ato do idem akpa mme asua ndufo se idʌñ do. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Ñyaisuan ndufo ke atu mme idịd ñnyʌñ nsio akañkañ mmi ibịne ndufo. Isọñ ndufo ayaakappa ndoon, ndin mme abio ndufo eyaewuuro. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Ndin isọñ ayaakop inem ke mme isua sabad amọ ke afịd ini a-anye anaaha ukpọk, nọ ndufo eba ke isọñ mme asua ndufo; ndin isọñ ayaaba ke emem anyʌñ akop inem mme sabad amọ. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Ke afịd ini a-anye anaaha ukpọk, isọñ ayaanie nduọkadudu a-anye imiikinieghe ke mme sabad a-ndufo ekedʌññọ do.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />“ ‘Amaado mbon esʌhọke ke atu ndufo, ñyaasịn ammọ ndịk ke esịd ke isọñ mme asua ammọ tutu uyio mfañ a-afịm anyeeñeke ayaanam ammọ efeeñe. Ammọ eyaefeeñe nte ebo ke efeeñe akañkañ, ndin ammọ eyaeduọññọ, akpesʌkado awo ndomokeed imiibịneke ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Ammọ eyaeduọññọ etọọñ idem ammọ nte ebo ke efeeñe akañkañ, akpesʌkado awo ndomokeed imiibịneke ammọ. Anam ndufo idiikanna ida ke iso mme asua ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Ndufo eyaetak ke atu mme idịd; isọñ mme asua ndufo ayaidia ndufo. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Ndufo mbon se isʌhọ eyaekpañña etak ke isọñ mme asua ndufo ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ ndufo; ñko eyaetak ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />“ ‘Ado ammọ ekpeyaara mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ ye ake mme eteete ammọ, unana akpanikọ ammọ ye naña ammọ esaña ke ndusuara ye ami, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />a-akenamma ami ñnyʌñ mba ke ndusuara ye ammọ nọ mbịn ammọ ndọñ ke isọñ mme asua ammọ, ndin ke esịd ammọ emaekedoro ufiọn emaesuuhọ nọ ammọ ekpe utịb idiọọkñkpọ ammọ, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />ñyaatoiyo edioomo mmi ye Yekọb, ye edioomo mmi ye Aisik, ye edioomo mmi ye Ebraham, ndin ñyaatoiyo isọñ ado. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Sia ammọ eyaekpọñ isọñ ndin isọñ ayaakop inem sabad amọ ke ammọ emaekpọñ nọ anye ana ukpọk. Ammọ eyaekpe utịb idiọọkñkpọ ammọ sia ammọ emaesịn mme mbed mmi enyʌñ esua mme ewʌhọ mmi. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Ado kpayeado, ke ini ammọ ebaaha ke isọñ mme asua ammọ, ami ndiisịnne ammọ ndiinyʌññọ nsua ammọ nọ akedo se nsobo ammọ afịd-afịd, nọ mbiat edioomo mmi ye ammọ mfep. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Ado ke ntak ammọ ami ñyaatoiyo edioomo mmi ye mme eteete ammọ a-ami ñkesioho ke Iyib ke iso mme idịd, nọ ndido Abasi ammọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Ami ado mme ewʌhọ, mme mbed ye mme item <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenịmme ke Abod Sainai ke ufọọd idem amọ ye nditọ Isrel ato ubọk Moses.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s1">Adifakka se Inie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Tañ nọ nditọ Isrel bo ammọ: ‘Awo ndomokeed akpenam asaña-asaña akaaña adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awo ke ukem-ukem ekọmudua awo ado, <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />yak ekọmudua awodeen tọọñọ ke isua edịb tutu asịm isua ata ado sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 575; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 27:16</char></note> silfa aba mme duob, akeene sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 12; se ñko ke Lefitikọs 27:25</char></note> adisana itie; <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />akpedo awonwaan, nịm ekọmudua amọ ke sekel edịb mme duob;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 345</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />awo akpedo isua ition tutu asịm isua edịb, yak ekọmudua awodeen ado sekel edịb,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 230</char></note> ake awonwaan ado sekel duob;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 115</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />tọọñọ ke ayịn afiọñ keed wuọ isua ition, yak ekọmudua awodeen ado sekel silfa ition,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 58</char></note> ake awonwaan ado sekel silfa ita;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 35</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />awo amaayọhọ isua ata me akanna ado, yak ekọmudua awodeen ado sekel duob mme ition,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 175</char></note> ake awonwaan ado sekel duob. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Akpedo awo a-anamma akaaña inieghe ñkpọ ikem se akpe ibad akʌk se enyịmme, yak eben awo e-ekamake enam akaaña do esọk aku, aku ndin ayaanịm ekọmudua akeene se awo a-anamma akaaña ado adiikan ikpe.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />“ ‘Adieke se ammọ ekekaañake adooho unam a-afọnnọ se enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, utọ unam ado e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> do akappa ado adisana. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Inaaha ammọ ekpəho anye me edat eti esịn ke itie idiọọk, me idiọọk ke itie eti; adieke anaaha ammọ edat unam keed ekpəho ye mfen, anye ado ye se edat ekpəho anye ediido ndisana. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Adieke se ammọ ekekaañake adooho ndedeghe unam, anye i-imiifọnnọ se ewa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana eben unam ado eka iso aku, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />ndin aku ayaatañ ekọmudua amọ, me ado eti me ado idiọọk. Se ekọmudua aku anịm, ado ke adiido. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Adieke andinie ayemme adifakka unam ado, ana anye adian mbakka keed ke itie ition ekọmudua ado.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />“ ‘Awo akpeben ufọk amọ anịm nte adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, aku ayaakpe udua amọ akeene naña aba, me ado eti me idiọọk. Se ekọmudua aku anịm, ntoro ke adiido. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Adieke awo a-anịmme ufọk amọ nte adisana ayemme adifakka ufọk ado, ana ammọ edian mbakka keed ke itie ition ekọmudua ufọk ado, ndin ufọk ado ayaamaana akappa ado ake ammọ.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“ ‘Adieke awo ndomokeed adiaññake ubaak isọñ ufọk ammọ anịm asaña-asaña anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ekọmudua amọ adiikeene ibad mfịd se isọñ ado akeme adiben, sekel silfa aba mme duob ke udomo homa baali keed.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 135</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Ekpediañña isọñ enịm ke Isua Yubili, ekọmudua emaekebebiere ayaasọñ ada. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Ado ammọ ekpediañña isọñ enịm ke Yubili amaakeboiyo, aku ayaanịm ekọmudua akeene ibad isua se isʌhọ mbemiso Isua Yubili mfen, ndin eyaesuuho ekọmudua ado. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Adieke awo a-anịmme isọñ amọ nte adisana ayemme adifakka anye, ana edian mbakka keed ke itie ition ekọmudua ado, ndin isọñ ado ayaamaana atịmme ado ake ammọ. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Akpedo anam ammọ ifakkake isọñ ado, me adooho ammọ e-enyam anye enọ awo mfen, awo ikemeke adifakka anye aba. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Emaesaana ikọd inwañ ado eyaak ke Isua Yubili, ayaakappa ado adisana, nte isọñ e-enịmme nte adisana enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; anye ayaakappa ado inie mme aku.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />“ ‘Awo akpediañña isọñ a-ammọ edeppedep enịm nte asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, i-imiidooho isọñ ufọk ammọ, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />aku ayaabiide ekọmudua amọ akewuọ Isua Yubili, ndin andinie ana akpe ekọmudua amọ ke usen ado nte ñkpọ a-adooho adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Ke Isua Yubili isọñ ado ayaatịmme abịne andikinyam anye, andikinie isọñ ado. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Enie edinịm afịd ekọmudua nte asañake akekem ke sekel adisana itie, kera edịb ke sekel.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />“ ‘Inaaha awo ndomokeed adiañña akpa ñyịn unam anịm nte adisana, sia akpa ñyịn amaanenie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; me abaakenañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ayaara me uman</char></note> me edọñ, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anie. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Adieke adooho keed ke atu mme ndedeghe unam, e-ekeme adifakka anye ke ekọmudua amọ, ke edianna mbakka keed ke itie ition ekọmudua ado. Adieke awo imiifakkake anye, enie edinyam anye ke ekọmudua amọ.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“ ‘Ado inaaha enyam me efak ñkpọ ndomokeed a-awo anieghe anyʌñ adiañña anịm anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, me awo me unam me isọñ ufọk ammọ; afịd se ekediañña enịm ke utọ usʌñ ado ado ataa adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="LEV 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />“ ‘Inaaha efakka awo ndomokeed ekediaññake enịm enọ nsobo; ana ewot anye.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />“ ‘Mbaak keed ke itie duob afịd ñkpọ se ito isọñ, me ñkpasi inwañ me mfịd eto, anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ado adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Awo akpeyem adifakka mbaak keed ke itie duob ado, ana adian mbaak keed ke itie ition ekọmudua amọ. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Afịd ayọhọ mbaak duob ke udịmenañ ye ke udịmedọñ, afịd ayọhọ unam duob a-asañake aboiyo ke idak esañ akpemeedọñ, adiido adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Ikpinaaha awo ndomokeed asio se ido eti ke atu ndiọi, me anam ukpəho ñkpọ. Adieke awo ndomokeed anamma ukpəho ñkpọ, unam ado ye anye e-edatta ekpəho eyaekappa edo ndisana ndin awo ikemeke adifakka ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Ami edo mme ewʌhọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses ke Abod Sainai anọ nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>